(1806589, 248265, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very sexy and nicely done, without being raunchy.  I love the use of grain here!!  I find it difficult to tell that the woman is wearing diamonds.  I love the desat with just the reds of her nails and the tattoo left in color.  I also like the extremely contrasty lighting.  Overall a very interesting picture.  My one comment might be that it bothers me that the hand on the left side of the picture is coming from nowhere seemingly... it would have been nice to be able to tell it''s connected to her body.  Fun image though! - 9 - Good luck.</td>', 'Very sexy and nicely done, without being raunchy.  I love the use of grain here!!  I find it difficult to tell that the woman is wearing diamonds.  I love the desat with just the reds of her nails and the tattoo left in color.  I also like the extremely contrasty lighting.  Overall a very interesting picture.  My one comment might be that it bothers me that the hand on the left side of the picture is coming from nowhere seemingly... it would have been nice to be able to tell it''s connected to her body.  Fun image though! - 9 - Good luck.', '2005-10-24 03:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
