(1806954, 248124, 37719, '<td valign="top">When you have spelling/grammer errors in your title it makes me think you don''t care about your entry.  Also, the grain appears to only be in your background and not your subject.</td>', 'When you have spelling/grammer errors in your title it makes me think you don''t care about your entry.  Also, the grain appears to only be in your background and not your subject.', '2005-10-24 09:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
