(1806967, 248246, 15711, '<td valign="top">OOH what a pretty setting. I like the reflection. The colors are beautiful.  I don''t see how there is much grain though.This might be cool in sepia too!</td>', 'OOH what a pretty setting. I like the reflection. The colors are beautiful.  I don''t see how there is much grain though.This might be cool in sepia too!', '2005-10-24 09:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806971, 247358, 37719, '<td valign="top">The challenge was to show image grain in your picture - not part of your picture.</td>', 'The challenge was to show image grain in your picture - not part of your picture.', '2005-10-24 09:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806972, 245970, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors.  I like the little twinkly lights around the tree. The leading line is effective and the tree makes a nice natural frame.</td>', 'Lovely colors.  I like the little twinkly lights around the tree. The leading line is effective and the tree makes a nice natural frame.', '2005-10-24 09:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806973, 246901, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  Beautiful coloration and stop action. Where''s the grain??</td>', 'This is a great shot.  Beautiful coloration and stop action. Where''s the grain??', '2005-10-24 09:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806974, 248007, 37719, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any image grain...</td>', 'I don''t see any image grain...', '2005-10-24 09:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806975, 245561, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is great. I love the centered hand.  This is really effective.  It would be a fun shot in black and white with high contrast too!!!  Very nice. 8</td>', 'Oh this is great. I love the centered hand.  This is really effective.  It would be a fun shot in black and white with high contrast too!!!  Very nice. 8', '2005-10-24 09:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806978, 247473, 37719, '<td valign="top">I see linear and consistent stripes in the image, but not image grain.</td>', 'I see linear and consistent stripes in the image, but not image grain.', '2005-10-24 09:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806980, 247147, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia finish, but I''m missing the grain&gt; Hmmmmmmmmmmm</td>', 'I like the sepia finish, but I''m missing the grain> Hmmmmmmmmmmm', '2005-10-24 09:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806981, 245496, 37719, '<td valign="top">I see a picture of a textured surface, but not image grain as evidenced in the window - no grain.</td>', 'I see a picture of a textured surface, but not image grain as evidenced in the window - no grain.', '2005-10-24 09:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806982, 247991, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of this.  The architecture of it works. I''d play with curves to really enhance the richness of the tones.  The shadow and light is good.</td>', 'I like the angle of this.  The architecture of it works. I''d play with curves to really enhance the richness of the tones.  The shadow and light is good.', '2005-10-24 09:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806985, 248364, 37719, '<td valign="top">The challenge was to have image grain in your photo - not a photo of white noise on tv with no image grain in the rest of the shot.</td>', 'The challenge was to have image grain in your photo - not a photo of white noise on tv with no image grain in the rest of the shot.', '2005-10-24 09:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806986, 248381, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this but it''s a bit too busy for my taste.  It is way over exposed too, so the flowers are almost "hot" and the figure is too blanched out.  Maybe an adjustment of curves would help.  Also, utilize the 640 pixelation, so that you can maximize the size of the shot.</td>', 'I like the idea of this but it''s a bit too busy for my taste.  It is way over exposed too, so the flowers are almost "hot" and the figure is too blanched out.  Maybe an adjustment of curves would help.  Also, utilize the 640 pixelation, so that you can maximize the size of the shot.', '2005-10-24 09:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806988, 247522, 37719, '<td valign="top">I see an out of focus image, not a grainy one.</td>', 'I see an out of focus image, not a grainy one.', '2005-10-24 09:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806989, 247330, 15711, '<td valign="top">HEE HEE - let''s see, there''s Uncle Joe, Aunt Miriam, my two cousins and my mother in law.  Yep, they''re all there!!!<br/> <br/>I like the yellow/orange lights in the background. Not sure if the grain really enhances it, but the colors are fun.</td>', 'HEE HEE - let''s see, there''s Uncle Joe, Aunt Miriam, my two cousins and my mother in law.  Yep, they''re all there!!! I like the yellow/orange lights in the background. Not sure if the grain really enhances it, but the colors are fun.', '2005-10-24 09:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806990, 248492, 37719, '<td valign="top">Wood grain is not image grain.</td>', 'Wood grain is not image grain.', '2005-10-24 09:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806991, 248063, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like what the grain does to this shot.  It seems a bit flat though. Hmmm - I wonder if maybe you pulled away just a bit to have some more negative space around her. I do like the detail of the smiling and the hand though.</td>', 'I like what the grain does to this shot.  It seems a bit flat though. Hmmm - I wonder if maybe you pulled away just a bit to have some more negative space around her. I do like the detail of the smiling and the hand though.', '2005-10-24 09:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806992, 248530, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the lights and the leading line.  But... where''s the grain?  Hmmmmmm</td>', 'I like the lights and the leading line.  But... where''s the grain?  Hmmmmmm', '2005-10-24 09:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806993, 248115, 37719, '<td valign="top">A little overdone in my opinion.  The border doesn''t help...again, just my opinion.</td>', 'A little overdone in my opinion.  The border doesn''t help...again, just my opinion.', '2005-10-24 09:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806994, 248462, 37719, '<td valign="top">I see an out of focus picture, not a grainy one.</td>', 'I see an out of focus picture, not a grainy one.', '2005-10-24 09:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806995, 246685, 37719, '<td valign="top">Where is the image grain?</td>', 'Where is the image grain?', '2005-10-24 09:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806997, 247306, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh good one. The person looks like a captured cornered bird. The white of the socks and tee shirt help draw your eye to the corner. Well composed. Would make a cool album cover!</td>', 'Oh good one. The person looks like a captured cornered bird. The white of the socks and tee shirt help draw your eye to the corner. Well composed. Would make a cool album cover!', '2005-10-24 09:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806998, 248275, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective.  The roundness of the clock helps add a curve to the otherwise geometric sense of it. The purple of the neon is a nice touch too.</td>', 'I like the perspective.  The roundness of the clock helps add a curve to the otherwise geometric sense of it. The purple of the neon is a nice touch too.', '2005-10-24 09:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806999, 248410, 15711, '<td valign="top">Um.... where is the grain????</td>', 'Um.... where is the grain????', '2005-10-24 09:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807000, 245659, 24111, '<td valign="top">Love the light , like an old master oil painitng and texture is beautiful</td>', 'Love the light , like an old master oil painitng and texture is beautiful', '2005-10-24 09:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807001, 247696, 15711, '<td valign="top">Perfect nostalgic yhoto. It does look like an old postcard. It seems just a touch tilted to the right. Maybe straighten it so the perpendicular lines of the barn are parallel with the bottom of the image. I think it might be more interesting if shot from a different perspective, instead of straight on.</td>', 'Perfect nostalgic yhoto. It does look like an old postcard. It seems just a touch tilted to the right. Maybe straighten it so the perpendicular lines of the barn are parallel with the bottom of the image. I think it might be more interesting if shot from a different perspective, instead of straight on.', '2005-10-24 09:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807002, 247365, 24111, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and haunting. Has a more ''misty'' quality than grainy, but wonderfully done</td>', 'Beautiful and haunting. Has a more ''misty'' quality than grainy, but wonderfully done', '2005-10-24 09:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807004, 248460, 35545, '<td valign="top">You  had a good idea, but the picture is too small -- I really had to look at it to figure out what it was.  Also, the composition is off -- way too much forground.</td>', 'You  had a good idea, but the picture is too small -- I really had to look at it to figure out what it was.  Also, the composition is off -- way too much forground.', '2005-10-24 09:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807005, 248080, 24111, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tender portrait</td>', 'Beautiful tender portrait', '2005-10-24 09:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807006, 247834, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting  with the hat, to create the shadow over the forehead. The expression is really sad.  I wish there were a twinkle in the eyes.  Maybe not - this adds to the "depressed" sense of it. Beautiful child. I''d like to see him/her  smiling in another shot.s ;~D</td>', 'Nice lighting  with the hat, to create the shadow over the forehead. The expression is really sad.  I wish there were a twinkle in the eyes.  Maybe not - this adds to the "depressed" sense of it. Beautiful child. I''d like to see him/her  smiling in another shot.s ;~D', '2005-10-24 09:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807008, 248344, 24111, '<td valign="top">Love the play of hands and the dark tones</td>', 'Love the play of hands and the dark tones', '2005-10-24 09:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807009, 248083, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this but it needs some more contrast in my opinion. Maybe adjust curves too.</td>', 'I like this but it needs some more contrast in my opinion. Maybe adjust curves too.', '2005-10-24 09:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807014, 248527, 24111, '<td valign="top">Very emotive and wonderfully done!</td>', 'Very emotive and wonderfully done!', '2005-10-24 09:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807018, 246201, 16241, '<td valign="top">thats cool</td>', 'thats cool', '2005-10-24 09:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807019, 247492, 24111, '<td valign="top">Love the idea of this, but the hot spots really distract.</td>', 'Love the idea of this, but the hot spots really distract.', '2005-10-24 09:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807021, 248116, 16241, '<td valign="top">i like it, rgo?</td>', 'i like it, rgo?', '2005-10-24 09:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807023, 247991, 35545, '<td valign="top">This is just me, but I would hve moved a little to the left to get this shot.  Either that or crop out a lot of the plaster -- it''s not that interesting to look at.  The bricks are great and get  your message across.  The door looks interesting, too.  I guess what I''m saying, at length, is that the composition could be better.  I love the colors of the bricks and the background.</td>', 'This is just me, but I would hve moved a little to the left to get this shot.  Either that or crop out a lot of the plaster -- it''s not that interesting to look at.  The bricks are great and get  your message across.  The door looks interesting, too.  I guess what I''m saying, at length, is that the composition could be better.  I love the colors of the bricks and the background.', '2005-10-24 09:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
