(1807117, 248498, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot... I like the subtle... slightly muted/grayish colors... I think that the image grain adds to the photo, although I can''t really put my finger on exactly how.  However, the grain does look a little fake to me, and not like what you would get from film.  -9-</td>', 'I like this image a lot... I like the subtle... slightly muted/grayish colors... I think that the image grain adds to the photo, although I can''t really put my finger on exactly how.  However, the grain does look a little fake to me, and not like what you would get from film.  -9-', '2005-10-24 10:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
