(1807138, 248032, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of grain.  Good use of a lot of key elements of photography here... good reflection, nice job getting down and getting a slightly different perspective, and thank you for having something in the foreground to add interest.  Good use of rule of thirds as well.  I like the sepia!</td>', 'Very nice use of grain.  Good use of a lot of key elements of photography here... good reflection, nice job getting down and getting a slightly different perspective, and thank you for having something in the foreground to add interest.  Good use of rule of thirds as well.  I like the sepia!', '2005-10-24 10:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
