(1807393, 245685, 40295, '<td valign="top">A good laugh - and works well with grain - truely enhances the image.</td>', 'A good laugh - and works well with grain - truely enhances the image.', '2005-10-24 13:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807395, 248415, 40295, '<td valign="top">The structure seems truncated - I look for a bit, not much, of space both at the bottom and top of the structure. As it is shown it seems squeezed into the image.</td>', 'The structure seems truncated - I look for a bit, not much, of space both at the bottom and top of the structure. As it is shown it seems squeezed into the image.', '2005-10-24 13:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807398, 247857, 40295, '<td valign="top">It colors seem a bit off - the greens of the grass and the trees in the sun.</td>', 'It colors seem a bit off - the greens of the grass and the trees in the sun.', '2005-10-24 13:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807400, 247473, 16106, '<td valign="top">the vertical banding is a bit heavy handed, and I dont'' know how it was suposed to support the mood or subject. other than that it is very well shot, rich with interesting textures.</td>', 'the vertical banding is a bit heavy handed, and I dont'' know how it was suposed to support the mood or subject. other than that it is very well shot, rich with interesting textures.', '2005-10-24 13:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807405, 245995, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent work... I love the look and feel, as well as the idea here.</td>', 'excellent work... I love the look and feel, as well as the idea here.', '2005-10-24 13:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807406, 248492, 37961, '<td valign="top">graphicfunk-  You have such a nice face. Love the stubble, very handsome.<br/> <br/>Your entry is unique as usual. Very interesting the way you did this.</td>', 'graphicfunk-  You have such a nice face. Love the stubble, very handsome. Your entry is unique as usual. Very interesting the way you did this.', '2005-10-24 13:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807408, 247506, 37961, '<td valign="top">Hmmm....Im guessing Scalvert?  Funny! I want one!</td>', 'Hmmm....Im guessing Scalvert?  Funny! I want one!', '2005-10-24 13:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807412, 247148, 37961, '<td valign="top">Im sympathetic to the plight of the coyote. Poor things. The image is emotive and the grain looks good on this photo. 10.</td>', 'Im sympathetic to the plight of the coyote. Poor things. The image is emotive and the grain looks good on this photo. 10.', '2005-10-24 13:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807414, 246762, 37961, '<td valign="top">Dynamic. 10.</td>', 'Dynamic. 10.', '2005-10-24 13:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807415, 247888, 16106, '<td valign="top">wow actuall grain, visible and everything, rather rare in this challenge. I wish there was a touch less blur on the man''s mustache and zipper, and that the two heads didn''t overlap. Never the less one of the best examples of grain in the challenge.</td>', 'wow actuall grain, visible and everything, rather rare in this challenge. I wish there was a touch less blur on the man''s mustache and zipper, and that the two heads didn''t overlap. Never the less one of the best examples of grain in the challenge.', '2005-10-24 13:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807416, 248175, 37961, '<td valign="top">I really love the red rose....but the pink ones in the background distract me. I would have preferred them to be red also. 7.</td>', 'I really love the red rose....but the pink ones in the background distract me. I would have preferred them to be red also. 7.', '2005-10-24 13:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807417, 248109, 40295, '<td valign="top">Looks like a classic. I would crop just a little of the sky - that woudl move the horizon more away from the center and accentuate the clouds  more and also provide more focus on the fishermen.</td>', 'Looks like a classic. I would crop just a little of the sky - that woudl move the horizon more away from the center and accentuate the clouds  more and also provide more focus on the fishermen.', '2005-10-24 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807418, 248160, 37961, '<td valign="top">delicate. I like.</td>', 'delicate. I like.', '2005-10-24 13:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807420, 245970, 40295, '<td valign="top">Unfortunatly the lights(?) on the tree are a real distraction to an otherwise very good image.</td>', 'Unfortunatly the lights(?) on the tree are a real distraction to an otherwise very good image.', '2005-10-24 13:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807424, 247484, 43565, '<td valign="top">IMO the deer should not be so overexposed.</td>', 'IMO the deer should not be so overexposed.', '2005-10-24 13:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807428, 248210, 43565, '<td valign="top">I do not think the grain adds anything to this shot.  I also think it would have been more interesting if he were handling the meat,</td>', 'I do not think the grain adds anything to this shot.  I also think it would have been more interesting if he were handling the meat,', '2005-10-24 13:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807434, 248286, 43565, '<td valign="top">I think that the left wall and the kids are a little too overexposed.</td>', 'I think that the left wall and the kids are a little too overexposed.', '2005-10-24 13:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807448, 248116, 17033, '<td valign="top">Having spent what feels like most of the last week stuck in various airports across the world, this picture has particular resonance for me! I imagine it''s very much like Schipol at 4:30a.m. which is a ghost town with just a few passengers trying to find somewhere to lie down, cleaners mopping the floors and noisy travelators carrying invisible hordes. You''ve caught the mood well..the feeling of half-life and isolation. Well done.</td>', 'Having spent what feels like most of the last week stuck in various airports across the world, this picture has particular resonance for me! I imagine it''s very much like Schipol at 4:30a.m. which is a ghost town with just a few passengers trying to find somewhere to lie down, cleaners mopping the floors and noisy travelators carrying invisible hordes. You''ve caught the mood well..the feeling of half-life and isolation. Well done.', '2005-10-24 13:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807456, 248468, 43565, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, but I think it would have worked better with a different log or driftwood.  I see the face, but I am not sure what the title means, and the shape just doesn''t hold my interest.</td>', 'This is a good idea, but I think it would have worked better with a different log or driftwood.  I see the face, but I am not sure what the title means, and the shape just doesn''t hold my interest.', '2005-10-24 13:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807459, 247834, 43565, '<td valign="top">Good capture of emotion.  I think different lighting could have created a darker mood overall to match the expression.</td>', 'Good capture of emotion.  I think different lighting could have created a darker mood overall to match the expression.', '2005-10-24 13:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807462, 247934, 43565, '<td valign="top">To me, celebration pictures should be bright and happy, not dark and grainy.  I think the composition would have been better with the cake closer to her and the cups removed.</td>', 'To me, celebration pictures should be bright and happy, not dark and grainy.  I think the composition would have been better with the cake closer to her and the cups removed.', '2005-10-24 13:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807491, 247662, 43565, '<td valign="top">I find the reflection and shadow distracting.</td>', 'I find the reflection and shadow distracting.', '2005-10-24 14:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807502, 245939, 43565, '<td valign="top">IMO there is a  too much noise, and the light at the bottom of the pumpkins and the streaks on the left are distracting.  It looks like the background might have been interesting if a little more detail showed.</td>', 'IMO there is a  too much noise, and the light at the bottom of the pumpkins and the streaks on the left are distracting.  It looks like the background might have been interesting if a little more detail showed.', '2005-10-24 14:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807504, 247346, 43019, '<td valign="top">I think this photograph is awesome! You did an excellent job catching this moment on your camera. Good luck!</td>', 'I think this photograph is awesome! You did an excellent job catching this moment on your camera. Good luck!', '2005-10-24 14:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807507, 248040, 43019, '<td valign="top">This photo is precious... I love the expression on the child''s face. Good capture!</td>', 'This photo is precious... I love the expression on the child''s face. Good capture!', '2005-10-24 14:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807517, 248103, 43565, '<td valign="top">IMO this scene does not work well with noise/grain.  I think grain goes more with  a dark or brooding atmosphere or an old-timey look.  I think this would be a good shot without the grain and in color.</td>', 'IMO this scene does not work well with noise/grain.  I think grain goes more with  a dark or brooding atmosphere or an old-timey look.  I think this would be a good shot without the grain and in color.', '2005-10-24 14:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807525, 248033, 43565, '<td valign="top">I can''t make out what is going on in this shot.</td>', 'I can''t make out what is going on in this shot.', '2005-10-24 14:13:21.000000', NULL, 1);
