(1807610, 247515, 26255, '<td valign="top">I don''t know, but for some reason, Blair Witch Project pops into my head immediately.  I love the image, the textures, the post-processing, everything.  My only nitpick is the cropped out thumb on the far right.</td>', 'I don''t know, but for some reason, Blair Witch Project pops into my head immediately.  I love the image, the textures, the post-processing, everything.  My only nitpick is the cropped out thumb on the far right.', '2005-10-24 14:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
