(1807623, 248394, 26255, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  I like it!</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  I like it!', '2005-10-24 14:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807628, 248037, 26255, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and texture!!!</td>', 'Nice lines and texture!!!', '2005-10-24 14:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807639, 248428, 26255, '<td valign="top">This is a great image.  I particularly like the birds.  I know the challenge was "Grain", but I''m afraid the noise does nothing to add to this image.</td>', 'This is a great image.  I particularly like the birds.  I know the challenge was "Grain", but I''m afraid the noise does nothing to add to this image.', '2005-10-24 14:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807650, 245847, 40718, '<td valign="top">Hilarious, we just used this very same beater at my parent''s house to make a cake (especially if it''s yellow).  I like the composition to fit the tight crop.  The noise is definitely there and I''m guessing you are going for an "old" feel.  The subject isn''t going to reach those emotional highs, but a good attempt. 7</td>', 'Hilarious, we just used this very same beater at my parent''s house to make a cake (especially if it''s yellow).  I like the composition to fit the tight crop.  The noise is definitely there and I''m guessing you are going for an "old" feel.  The subject isn''t going to reach those emotional highs, but a good attempt. 7', '2005-10-24 14:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807656, 247492, 43031, '<td valign="top">weird, eherial, too contrasty. kinda creepy, looks like she''s standing in a stagnant black ocean.  But I like it!</td>', 'weird, eherial, too contrasty. kinda creepy, looks like she''s standing in a stagnant black ocean.  But I like it!', '2005-10-24 14:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807657, 247266, 40718, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture, but I will say I was hoping for much more grain.  What is it adding here?</td>', 'Excellent picture, but I will say I was hoping for much more grain.  What is it adding here?', '2005-10-24 14:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807664, 248065, 40718, '<td valign="top">An excellent picture, but I was hoping for waay more grain.  The colors and composition are wonderful, so there''s no way I can give a low score, but it also isn''t going to get a top one. 6</td>', 'An excellent picture, but I was hoping for waay more grain.  The colors and composition are wonderful, so there''s no way I can give a low score, but it also isn''t going to get a top one. 6', '2005-10-24 14:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807670, 245995, 40718, '<td valign="top">hmmm, would the subject say "more grain"?  At first I thought this, but then I think it wouldn''t add.  The grain does a nice job here.  I will say though, I am all over the board on voting here and it''s hard to be consistent.  Sucks you spelled "speak" wrong. 7</td>', 'hmmm, would the subject say "more grain"?  At first I thought this, but then I think it wouldn''t add.  The grain does a nice job here.  I will say though, I am all over the board on voting here and it''s hard to be consistent.  Sucks you spelled "speak" wrong. 7', '2005-10-24 15:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807672, 248115, 43031, '<td valign="top">well, that kind of came out as noise instead of grain. Try copying the layer to a new one (if you can use layers) and then add grain, desaturate (black/white) and then apply the layer in blending mode on screen/hardlight/softlight or something, and changing the opacity to 50% or so. a couple of passes with the add noise, will make it more chunky.</td>', 'well, that kind of came out as noise instead of grain. Try copying the layer to a new one (if you can use layers) and then add grain, desaturate (black/white) and then apply the layer in blending mode on screen/hardlight/softlight or something, and changing the opacity to 50% or so. a couple of passes with the add noise, will make it more chunky.', '2005-10-24 15:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807681, 248176, 40718, '<td valign="top">Is this you bear?  I like this one a lot.  It''s at a 6 for the moment, but I''m sure I''ll bump it up the second time through.  Good amount of grain (I can see it!).  Nice subject and mood.  The grain enhances on this one.</td>', 'Is this you bear?  I like this one a lot.  It''s at a 6 for the moment, but I''m sure I''ll bump it up the second time through.  Good amount of grain (I can see it!).  Nice subject and mood.  The grain enhances on this one.', '2005-10-24 15:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807693, 245995, 11897, '<td valign="top">Another excellent rendition Mandy.</td>', 'Another excellent rendition Mandy.', '2005-10-24 15:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807698, 247656, 40718, '<td valign="top">Ah, I hate entries like this.  It is a wonderful photo!  Excellent!  But where is the grain?  I can hardly see it.  Therefore, what is it adding?  There''s no way I can give you below a 5, but my 8-10 scores are for entries which make use of scads of grain.  Bottom line though, this is an excellent photo. 6</td>', 'Ah, I hate entries like this.  It is a wonderful photo!  Excellent!  But where is the grain?  I can hardly see it.  Therefore, what is it adding?  There''s no way I can give you below a 5, but my 8-10 scores are for entries which make use of scads of grain.  Bottom line though, this is an excellent photo. 6', '2005-10-24 15:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807705, 246924, 11897, '<td valign="top">I think the grain is way over the top but what a result, wonderful picture, good luck 10</td>', 'I think the grain is way over the top but what a result, wonderful picture, good luck 10', '2005-10-24 15:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1807710, 245659, 11897, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2005-10-24 15:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
