(1807749, 247365, 35804, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this image, but...at least on my monitor, I don''t see any "grain"...regardless, this is just so fabulous and haunting.</td>', 'I absolutely love this image, but...at least on my monitor, I don''t see any "grain"...regardless, this is just so fabulous and haunting.', '2005-10-24 15:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
