(1808097, 248362, 12243, '<td valign="top">What a precious little bundle. Nothing like a baby to get the heart string moving. This looks like a brand newbie one too. I love how the bubs little finger is in focus and i love the fact that his/hers nail is slightly ripped, just like a new baby looks. Such a precious moment. 9</td>', 'What a precious little bundle. Nothing like a baby to get the heart string moving. This looks like a brand newbie one too. I love how the bubs little finger is in focus and i love the fact that his/hers nail is slightly ripped, just like a new baby looks. Such a precious moment. 9', '2005-10-24 17:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808099, 247662, 39349, '<td valign="top">MMMM....second muscle car in this challenge I''ve come across. You''ve nailed this challenge for me.! Love the b/w tones in this shot and the reflection in the polished rims is beautifully captured without being overdone.  10!</td>', 'MMMM....second muscle car in this challenge I''ve come across. You''ve nailed this challenge for me.! Love the b/w tones in this shot and the reflection in the polished rims is beautifully captured without being overdone.  10!', '2005-10-24 17:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
