(1808104, 247365, 26756, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous image, but I am straining my eyes trying to find image grain.  Is this image clear?  Tom Cruise would say "Crystal".  Or I''m nuts.  Beautiful pic otherwise.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous image, but I am straining my eyes trying to find image grain.  Is this image clear?  Tom Cruise would say "Crystal".  Or I''m nuts.  Beautiful pic otherwise.', '2005-10-24 17:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808109, 245994, 39349, '<td valign="top">Okay, 3rd muscle car in this challenge, and that''s a good thing! I really like this shot, but there''s only a couple of things working against you here. The greenish / blue part in the upper left hand corner takes away from the orange / yellow tones you have working in the main subject of the image. I also think you''d have more impact if we could see more of the tires/rims. <br/> <br/>Overall I love it though! Good job!</td>', 'Okay, 3rd muscle car in this challenge, and that''s a good thing! I really like this shot, but there''s only a couple of things working against you here. The greenish / blue part in the upper left hand corner takes away from the orange / yellow tones you have working in the main subject of the image. I also think you''d have more impact if we could see more of the tires/rims.  Overall I love it though! Good job!', '2005-10-24 17:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808125, 248531, 43565, '<td valign="top">This looks more out of focus than grainy on my monitor.  I think a different angle would have added more interest.</td>', 'This looks more out of focus than grainy on my monitor.  I think a different angle would have added more interest.', '2005-10-24 18:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808130, 248381, 43565, '<td valign="top">I would like this better if the left half was not overexposed.</td>', 'I would like this better if the left half was not overexposed.', '2005-10-24 18:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
