(1808643, 246126, 34058, '<td valign="top">I am not one to nit pick, but I think the description to the challenge was changed to image grain,  not the eatible kind...  but, I like your picture, and I don''t score low if it doesn''t meet the challenge to a tee.  I like it!</td>', 'I am not one to nit pick, but I think the description to the challenge was changed to image grain,  not the eatible kind...  but, I like your picture, and I don''t score low if it doesn''t meet the challenge to a tee.  I like it!', '2005-10-24 21:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
