(1808703, 246709, 13026, '<td valign="top">Hmm, you were right, ma friend.  I do like this one.  :)<br/>Is that your daddy?  I recognize the little barn/house thinger from one of your older shots, do I not?</td>', 'Hmm, you were right, ma friend.  I do like this one.  :)Is that your daddy?  I recognize the little barn/house thinger from one of your older shots, do I not?', '2005-10-24 22:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
