(1808727, 247311, 3724, '<td valign="top">Good composition......  am assuming by format,  minor or no crop from the original  -  I might like it a little tighter on top, as I see it as I write,  &amp; slightly on the right side,  but certianly this is very effective.   Background and black dress merge to bind the figure 2d in this space.</td>', 'Good composition......  am assuming by format,  minor or no crop from the original  -  I might like it a little tighter on top, as I see it as I write,  & slightly on the right side,  but certianly this is very effective.   Background and black dress merge to bind the figure 2d in this space.', '2005-10-24 22:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
