(1808741, 248422, 13026, '<td valign="top">I think I recognize this model from someone''s portfolio, but I cannot remember who on earth it was...<br/>Lovely image, the centered comp may not work for some ppl here, but I like it.  :)</td>', 'I think I recognize this model from someone''s portfolio, but I cannot remember who on earth it was...Lovely image, the centered comp may not work for some ppl here, but I like it.  :)', '2005-10-24 22:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808753, 246275, 34058, '<td valign="top">I think you have a good idea here, just a few things I would change, the red spot in the eye and the red on the eye, just doesn''t add anything to the picture.  Also, all the little black spots on her face just look out of place.</td>', 'I think you have a good idea here, just a few things I would change, the red spot in the eye and the red on the eye, just doesn''t add anything to the picture.  Also, all the little black spots on her face just look out of place.', '2005-10-24 22:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808755, 248439, 7743, '<td valign="top">The idea is good and the centered person seems to work.  Ease up on the grain though.</td>', 'The idea is good and the centered person seems to work.  Ease up on the grain though.', '2005-10-24 22:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808759, 248372, 7743, '<td valign="top">Very cute portrait.  A more subtle application of grain I think would have worked better.</td>', 'Very cute portrait.  A more subtle application of grain I think would have worked better.', '2005-10-24 22:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808769, 248293, 7743, '<td valign="top">The grain works very well with your image however I feel that the border is quite distracting since it is brighter than any other part of the image.</td>', 'The grain works very well with your image however I feel that the border is quite distracting since it is brighter than any other part of the image.', '2005-10-24 22:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808785, 248344, 7743, '<td valign="top">Though I like this image and the grain seems to work well, the two different hands, one old, one young, makes the image feel out of balance.</td>', 'Though I like this image and the grain seems to work well, the two different hands, one old, one young, makes the image feel out of balance.', '2005-10-24 22:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808802, 248232, 34058, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what this is.  Interesting though!</td>', 'Not really sure what this is.  Interesting though!', '2005-10-24 22:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808810, 248244, 43874, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful shot.  The grain really works well with this shot.  Love the tones.</td>', 'Very beautiful shot.  The grain really works well with this shot.  Love the tones.', '2005-10-24 22:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808811, 247981, 43874, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous shot.  I think I would have liked it even more without the grain, tho.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous shot.  I think I would have liked it even more without the grain, tho.', '2005-10-24 22:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808829, 248290, 40718, '<td valign="top">I am a fan of selective desat, but I know there are others on this site who are not.  However, I''m not sure the subject causes a lot of feeling in me.  The grain is there, but minimal.  I think it is attempting to add a texture to feel like a misty rain.  It succeeds, but only just. 5</td>', 'I am a fan of selective desat, but I know there are others on this site who are not.  However, I''m not sure the subject causes a lot of feeling in me.  The grain is there, but minimal.  I think it is attempting to add a texture to feel like a misty rain.  It succeeds, but only just. 5', '2005-10-24 22:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808834, 248439, 43874, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  The grain works so well here.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  The grain works so well here.', '2005-10-24 22:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808836, 248388, 40718, '<td valign="top">I''m happier with people who had the guts to do a good amount of grain.  I don''t like the gradient however.  What is it doing for the picture?  There were a number of ways to add the grain as well, and I''m not a big fan of this type. The subject was a good one for a grainy image. 5</td>', 'I''m happier with people who had the guts to do a good amount of grain.  I don''t like the gradient however.  What is it doing for the picture?  There were a number of ways to add the grain as well, and I''m not a big fan of this type. The subject was a good one for a grainy image. 5', '2005-10-24 22:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808837, 248356, 43874, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Looks like a movie still.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Looks like a movie still.', '2005-10-24 22:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808840, 247365, 40718, '<td valign="top">Every time I see a horse shot I have to think it''s lynnesite.  Is it you?  This picture is excellent in composition, lighting, and subject.  It is utterly lacking in the grain I''m looking for (when I pull the laptop to 10" from my eyes to see if there is noise or not, that''s not a good sign).  I''ll give you a 5 just cuz it''s a really nice pic.</td>', 'Every time I see a horse shot I have to think it''s lynnesite.  Is it you?  This picture is excellent in composition, lighting, and subject.  It is utterly lacking in the grain I''m looking for (when I pull the laptop to 10" from my eyes to see if there is noise or not, that''s not a good sign).  I''ll give you a 5 just cuz it''s a really nice pic.', '2005-10-24 22:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808843, 248054, 40718, '<td valign="top">Great subject, great tonality.  Where is the grain?  It''s so mild I can''t tell whether that is her natural skin texture or not.  I''m giving it a 5, but know that I really like the pic.</td>', 'Great subject, great tonality.  Where is the grain?  It''s so mild I can''t tell whether that is her natural skin texture or not.  I''m giving it a 5, but know that I really like the pic.', '2005-10-24 22:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808847, 245659, 43874, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours and lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful colours and lighting.', '2005-10-24 22:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808850, 247534, 40718, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject.  I go back and forth as to whether the grain is adding something or not.  I think so, but just barely.  It isn''t too noticeable as there is a lot of texture in the water already.</td>', 'An interesting subject.  I go back and forth as to whether the grain is adding something or not.  I think so, but just barely.  It isn''t too noticeable as there is a lot of texture in the water already.', '2005-10-24 22:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808854, 248004, 40718, '<td valign="top">A good subject for grain, but I don''t really like the superstark white behind which is unmarred.  I go back and forth on this one.  I''m giving it a 6 at the moment, but I may be back for a higher number.</td>', 'A good subject for grain, but I don''t really like the superstark white behind which is unmarred.  I go back and forth on this one.  I''m giving it a 6 at the moment, but I may be back for a higher number.', '2005-10-24 22:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808858, 245659, 40718, '<td valign="top">It seems that the "noise" is a natural texture of the pear.  I was looking for something more dramatic.  However, to comment on the rest of the picture, the lighting is wonderful, the subjects are nice for a still life and the colors are subtle, yet contrasty enough for some oomph.  I''m just not sure this is a good grain image.  Even if you were to up the grain, would it be adding or detracting from the subject?  I''m just not sure pears need grain.</td>', 'It seems that the "noise" is a natural texture of the pear.  I was looking for something more dramatic.  However, to comment on the rest of the picture, the lighting is wonderful, the subjects are nice for a still life and the colors are subtle, yet contrasty enough for some oomph.  I''m just not sure this is a good grain image.  Even if you were to up the grain, would it be adding or detracting from the subject?  I''m just not sure pears need grain.', '2005-10-24 22:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808863, 248256, 40718, '<td valign="top">The sky is nice and angry, but I think its the high contrast rather than the moderate grain which is adding the mood.  I had it as a 5, but I''m bumping to a 6 for now.  You do accomplish something here, but you just aren''t blowing me away as a picture I would point to someone and say, "this is a great use of grain".  The composition and placement of the horses are nice.</td>', 'The sky is nice and angry, but I think its the high contrast rather than the moderate grain which is adding the mood.  I had it as a 5, but I''m bumping to a 6 for now.  You do accomplish something here, but you just aren''t blowing me away as a picture I would point to someone and say, "this is a great use of grain".  The composition and placement of the horses are nice.', '2005-10-24 23:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808868, 247482, 40718, '<td valign="top">Darling portrait, not one, however, where I think grain is adding anything.  I''m thinking grain adds a feeling of moodiness, melancholy, nostalgia or antiquity.  This little pixie isn''t giving me any of that (and she shouldn''t).  I do see grain there, but I''m also looking for serious grain for my top scores.  I''ll give you a neutral 5 which winds up not helping or hurting you much.  Takeaway: she''s a cutie.</td>', 'Darling portrait, not one, however, where I think grain is adding anything.  I''m thinking grain adds a feeling of moodiness, melancholy, nostalgia or antiquity.  This little pixie isn''t giving me any of that (and she shouldn''t).  I do see grain there, but I''m also looking for serious grain for my top scores.  I''ll give you a neutral 5 which winds up not helping or hurting you much.  Takeaway: she''s a cutie.', '2005-10-24 23:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808873, 248155, 40718, '<td valign="top">high key images are hard with grain.  Natural film grain is less apparent in whites, and in that, I think you mimic it well.  I was going to ask what the grain was adding, but I think it does add texture.  It doesn''t enhance a mood, but works as a visual device.  Too bad this isn''t in the light-on-white challenge.</td>', 'high key images are hard with grain.  Natural film grain is less apparent in whites, and in that, I think you mimic it well.  I was going to ask what the grain was adding, but I think it does add texture.  It doesn''t enhance a mood, but works as a visual device.  Too bad this isn''t in the light-on-white challenge.', '2005-10-24 23:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808876, 247933, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like her expression...for me, if there was a dash more of grain, I would have given it a ten. 8</td>', 'I like her expression...for me, if there was a dash more of grain, I would have given it a ten. 8', '2005-10-24 23:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808879, 246920, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice rustic-looking photo. I like it. The sepia tones work really well.  Congratulations on a good entry and good luck in the challenge. 8</td>', 'Nice rustic-looking photo. I like it. The sepia tones work really well.  Congratulations on a good entry and good luck in the challenge. 8', '2005-10-24 23:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808886, 246506, 40718, '<td valign="top">Well, I give you props for not being chicken with the grain.  It''s too bad in the way it was applied by the filter.  Why for example, does the horizon to the right of the boat have two textures of grain?  It looks the same to me tonally, it should have the same grain.  The top 1/6th of the sky is the same.  Otherwise the subject is an appropriate one for grain to enahnce.</td>', 'Well, I give you props for not being chicken with the grain.  It''s too bad in the way it was applied by the filter.  Why for example, does the horizon to the right of the boat have two textures of grain?  It looks the same to me tonally, it should have the same grain.  The top 1/6th of the sky is the same.  Otherwise the subject is an appropriate one for grain to enahnce.', '2005-10-24 23:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808890, 248530, 40718, '<td valign="top">A good subject for grain to enhance, we think of mass transportation as being dirty or gritty.  But where is your grain?  I hold the screen 6" from my face and I still can''t see it.  I was hoping for some serious grain, and I think you''ll see the winners will be clear in their application of the texture.</td>', 'A good subject for grain to enhance, we think of mass transportation as being dirty or gritty.  But where is your grain?  I hold the screen 6" from my face and I still can''t see it.  I was hoping for some serious grain, and I think you''ll see the winners will be clear in their application of the texture.', '2005-10-24 23:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808894, 248492, 40718, '<td valign="top">A good subject for grain, I think the vertical filter is too bad.</td>', 'A good subject for grain, I think the vertical filter is too bad.', '2005-10-24 23:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808896, 248412, 40718, '<td valign="top">Color noise is probably not going to do too well in this challenge because it doesn''t look as appealing as the grain film gives you.  Next time, if you want to try this again, select "monochrome" under the add noise filter.  That may give you a better effect.</td>', 'Color noise is probably not going to do too well in this challenge because it doesn''t look as appealing as the grain film gives you.  Next time, if you want to try this again, select "monochrome" under the add noise filter.  That may give you a better effect.', '2005-10-24 23:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808900, 248111, 40718, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot.  Where is the grain?  compared to my favorites, this hardly has any.  I''m not going to give you a terrible score, but it''s gonna be neutral at best.  The shot really is nice though.</td>', 'A beautiful shot.  Where is the grain?  compared to my favorites, this hardly has any.  I''m not going to give you a terrible score, but it''s gonna be neutral at best.  The shot really is nice though.', '2005-10-24 23:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808910, 247266, 41675, '<td valign="top">This is really quite a lovely portrait of a pretty girl. I like the different angle, and it looks likes she''s daydreaming. Had there been more grain (or noise) I would have scored this higher. Definitely a picture to be proud of.</td>', 'This is really quite a lovely portrait of a pretty girl. I like the different angle, and it looks likes she''s daydreaming. Had there been more grain (or noise) I would have scored this higher. Definitely a picture to be proud of.', '2005-10-24 23:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808930, 247981, 19035, '<td valign="top">bravo, what an image!  10.</td>', 'bravo, what an image!  10.', '2005-10-24 23:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808932, 248447, 19035, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait, meets the challenge, excellent composition and lighting.  9.</td>', 'Wonderful portrait, meets the challenge, excellent composition and lighting.  9.', '2005-10-24 23:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
