(1808966, 248528, 41522, '<td valign="top">I''ve come to this image several times to look at it and I keep thinking the same thing.  For me, this isn''t a photo with grain as much as it is a form of digital art.  JMO.</td>', 'I''ve come to this image several times to look at it and I keep thinking the same thing.  For me, this isn''t a photo with grain as much as it is a form of digital art.  JMO.', '2005-10-24 23:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808969, 246709, 41522, '<td valign="top">Excellent processing on this image.  I find the grain to realy add t the overall image to create a nice mood and feeling.  Good work.</td>', 'Excellent processing on this image.  I find the grain to realy add t the overall image to create a nice mood and feeling.  Good work.', '2005-10-24 23:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808976, 246836, 41522, '<td valign="top">Good image.  The composition is nice and the grain, along with the excellent processing, adds a nice mood.</td>', 'Good image.  The composition is nice and the grain, along with the excellent processing, adds a nice mood.', '2005-10-24 23:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808981, 247981, 41522, '<td valign="top">Very nice work.  Excellent composition.  Great mood captured in the young man and accentuated in the grain, IMHO.  I believe this should do well in this challenge.</td>', 'Very nice work.  Excellent composition.  Great mood captured in the young man and accentuated in the grain, IMHO.  I believe this should do well in this challenge.', '2005-10-24 23:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808988, 248439, 41522, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Great mood to this image and the grain IS a value added component to help deliver the mood.  A very good composition, apropriately breaking the rule of thirds with its symmetry.  Wonderful tones, excellent procesing and great title.  Good luck.</td>', 'Well done.  Great mood to this image and the grain IS a value added component to help deliver the mood.  A very good composition, apropriately breaking the rule of thirds with its symmetry.  Wonderful tones, excellent procesing and great title.  Good luck.', '2005-10-25 00:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808995, 247522, 41522, '<td valign="top">I feel that the composition layout is good, but the image is eld back with poor focus.  Also, I feel that the colour of the eyes is a bit over-saturated.  JMO.</td>', 'I feel that the composition layout is good, but the image is eld back with poor focus.  Also, I feel that the colour of the eyes is a bit over-saturated.  JMO.', '2005-10-25 00:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1808998, 245984, 19035, '<td valign="top">I am in love with this photo, one of only two 10''s given out by me in this challenge, good luck, I hope a ribbon comes your way.</td>', 'I am in love with this photo, one of only two 10''s given out by me in this challenge, good luck, I hope a ribbon comes your way.', '2005-10-25 00:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809011, 246937, 41522, '<td valign="top">I see the grain in the image an it is a good level of grain.  I would have liked this to have had even more of an unfocused look.  The focus level in this image has resulted in lost details but with a little more blur, and maybe a little less overall exposure, a more moody image might have been created.  JMO.</td>', 'I see the grain in the image an it is a good level of grain.  I would have liked this to have had even more of an unfocused look.  The focus level in this image has resulted in lost details but with a little more blur, and maybe a little less overall exposure, a more moody image might have been created.  JMO.', '2005-10-25 00:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809020, 246275, 41522, '<td valign="top">I think the composition of this portrait is really good.  The red eye and lack of focus are a problem for me.</td>', 'I think the composition of this portrait is really good.  The red eye and lack of focus are a problem for me.', '2005-10-25 00:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809023, 248217, 41522, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I''m not seeing any real image grain present.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I''m not seeing any real image grain present.', '2005-10-25 00:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809096, 246762, 35513, '<td valign="top">Really nice colors on this shot!!  I like it quite a bit :-)  Black background looks good and the grain adds to the picture well.</td>', 'Really nice colors on this shot!!  I like it quite a bit :-)  Black background looks good and the grain adds to the picture well.', '2005-10-25 00:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809102, 245871, 35513, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Really cool grungy shot!  This is a very nice capture anad works especially well with this challenge topic.</td>', 'WOW!  Really cool grungy shot!  This is a very nice capture anad works especially well with this challenge topic.', '2005-10-25 00:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809120, 247822, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice blur motion!  Good colors and good composition.  Very nice shot.</td>', 'Nice blur motion!  Good colors and good composition.  Very nice shot.', '2005-10-25 00:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809172, 248439, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting, which is giving good coloration to the photo.  This meets the challenge description very well and the grain definitely helps set the mood of this pic.  Very well done.</td>', 'Very nice lighting, which is giving good coloration to the photo.  This meets the challenge description very well and the grain definitely helps set the mood of this pic.  Very well done.', '2005-10-25 00:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809181, 248344, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wonderful title :-)  The lighting on this shot is really good, and I love how the right hand is lighter than the left (almost symbolizing the key colors!)  I might be interested to see this shot with a little more space at either the top or the bottom of the photo to try and get the hands in more of a 1/3 position.  But great shot and the grain goes over well!</td>', 'Wonderful title :-)  The lighting on this shot is really good, and I love how the right hand is lighter than the left (almost symbolizing the key colors!)  I might be interested to see this shot with a little more space at either the top or the bottom of the photo to try and get the hands in more of a 1/3 position.  But great shot and the grain goes over well!', '2005-10-25 00:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809184, 248447, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and nice B&amp;W.  Grain really makes this seem like a turn of the century photo (except for the clarity of the shot, which is nice!)</td>', 'Good lighting and nice B&W.  Grain really makes this seem like a turn of the century photo (except for the clarity of the shot, which is nice!)', '2005-10-25 00:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809191, 248037, 35513, '<td valign="top">Really neat composition and lighting!  The grain isn''t staring me in the face, which I like....what you''ve done adds to the pic instead of taking away.</td>', 'Really neat composition and lighting!  The grain isn''t staring me in the face, which I like....what you''ve done adds to the pic instead of taking away.', '2005-10-25 00:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809208, 247662, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is just gorgeous.  Your toning is spectacular, and the composition is perfect - the contrast is just right, and everything is sharp without going overboard.  Beautiful work.</td>', 'This is just gorgeous.  Your toning is spectacular, and the composition is perfect - the contrast is just right, and everything is sharp without going overboard.  Beautiful work.', '2005-10-25 01:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809229, 246521, 35513, '<td valign="top">Interesting sillhouette and colors in this shot!  I like that the black doesn''t look grainy, but the sky does...nice effect!</td>', 'Interesting sillhouette and colors in this shot!  I like that the black doesn''t look grainy, but the sky does...nice effect!', '2005-10-25 01:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809233, 248381, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice composition on this shot and beautiful flowers!  I think that a little bit of levels adjustment might bring out some of the shadows and lights/darks in this photo.</td>', 'Nice composition on this shot and beautiful flowers!  I think that a little bit of levels adjustment might bring out some of the shadows and lights/darks in this photo.', '2005-10-25 01:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809235, 246933, 36563, '<td valign="top">This is such a powerful and emotional image; grain is a difficult thing to add to an image without ruining it, but the addition of grain works wonders here. Excellent capture!</td>', 'This is such a powerful and emotional image; grain is a difficult thing to add to an image without ruining it, but the addition of grain works wonders here. Excellent capture!', '2005-10-25 01:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809242, 248290, 35513, '<td valign="top">The selective desat on this draws the eye nicely!  Good perspective and angle.</td>', 'The selective desat on this draws the eye nicely!  Good perspective and angle.', '2005-10-25 01:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
