(1809251, 247506, 35513, '<td valign="top">Hahahaha!  I love it!  Where can I buy one???  Really neat effect, and a refreshing take on the image grain theme!  Huzzah!</td>', 'Hahahaha!  I love it!  Where can I buy one???  Really neat effect, and a refreshing take on the image grain theme!  Huzzah!', '2005-10-25 01:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809253, 247482, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great expression on her face and good lighting!</td>', 'Great expression on her face and good lighting!', '2005-10-25 01:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809256, 245847, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wow!  If you can believe it, I think I had the model that was even EARLIER than this!  And a Sunbeam too!!  Nice vintage look to this vintage subject.</td>', 'Wow!  If you can believe it, I think I had the model that was even EARLIER than this!  And a Sunbeam too!!  Nice vintage look to this vintage subject.', '2005-10-25 01:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809260, 246927, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a really neat art effect!  This image is really striking and I like it :-)  The colors are good and I think it''s a good example of what extreme grain can do to completely change a photo.  Very nice pointillism effect.</td>', 'Wow, what a really neat art effect!  This image is really striking and I like it :-)  The colors are good and I think it''s a good example of what extreme grain can do to completely change a photo.  Very nice pointillism effect.', '2005-10-25 01:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809264, 248032, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice vintage look to this shot!  The light on the leaves at the right of the pic is slightly distracting, but the windmill is very fetching!  Good composition.</td>', 'Very nice vintage look to this shot!  The light on the leaves at the right of the pic is slightly distracting, but the windmill is very fetching!  Good composition.', '2005-10-25 01:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809269, 248124, 35513, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and composition!  The grain in the background almost gives a pointilism effect, which is really nice.  Very well done!</td>', 'Beautiful colors and composition!  The grain in the background almost gives a pointilism effect, which is really nice.  Very well done!', '2005-10-25 01:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809273, 247933, 26756, '<td valign="top">what an awesome shot.  Grain looks good, not overdone, not too little.  Fits the shot nicely.  Shit''s a tad overexposed but everything else is perfect.  Nice work.</td>', 'what an awesome shot.  Grain looks good, not overdone, not too little.  Fits the shot nicely.  Shit''s a tad overexposed but everything else is perfect.  Nice work.', '2005-10-25 01:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809275, 247981, 35513, '<td valign="top">GREAT expression!  Wonderful lighting and the image grain looks fabulous here.</td>', 'GREAT expression!  Wonderful lighting and the image grain looks fabulous here.', '2005-10-25 01:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809277, 248498, 10268, '<td valign="top">My own personal view on this, being a huge fan of grain, is it doesn''t work so well in this shot.  I think it''s an awesome shot, but perhaps a litle overboard on the grain, or noise whichever it is.  Still a 7 though.  Really nice.</td>', 'My own personal view on this, being a huge fan of grain, is it doesn''t work so well in this shot.  I think it''s an awesome shot, but perhaps a litle overboard on the grain, or noise whichever it is.  Still a 7 though.  Really nice.', '2005-10-25 01:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809281, 248155, 10268, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Maybe the flower is just a tad overexposed on the one side, but still, I like it a lot.  7.</td>', 'Very nice!  Maybe the flower is just a tad overexposed on the one side, but still, I like it a lot.  7.', '2005-10-25 01:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809289, 246582, 10268, '<td valign="top">I was trying to find a better way to put it, but I can''t really come up with anything other than that I don''t find any interest in this at all.  My eyes wander trying to find a subject, and something to focus on, but I can''t find anything.</td>', 'I was trying to find a better way to put it, but I can''t really come up with anything other than that I don''t find any interest in this at all.  My eyes wander trying to find a subject, and something to focus on, but I can''t find anything.', '2005-10-25 01:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809298, 247933, 10268, '<td valign="top">Haha, cute.  And a really nice portrait.  Nice lighting, and focus, and use of grain!  8.</td>', 'Haha, cute.  And a really nice portrait.  Nice lighting, and focus, and use of grain!  8.', '2005-10-25 01:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809322, 246201, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject however the border distracts as it is brighter than most of the image.</td>', 'Good choice of subject however the border distracts as it is brighter than most of the image.', '2005-10-25 01:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809325, 246521, 7743, '<td valign="top">As the eye is led to the cross at the top I think it may work better as a vertical composition with a little more space above the cross.</td>', 'As the eye is led to the cross at the top I think it may work better as a vertical composition with a little more space above the cross.', '2005-10-25 01:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809345, 248238, 16790, '<td valign="top">Composition is good, and you''ve got the action very nicely frozen.  I''m seeing an appropriate amount of grain; overall, it meets the challenge.  However, I''d really like to see this either a) with considerably more contrast, or b) with some colour.  Actually, some wild contrast AND colour would look pretty great, too :)  As it is, your subject and background are kind of battling each other for attention - and this is a better shot than that!  Good luck, this is a nice action capture.</td>', 'Composition is good, and you''ve got the action very nicely frozen.  I''m seeing an appropriate amount of grain; overall, it meets the challenge.  However, I''d really like to see this either a) with considerably more contrast, or b) with some colour.  Actually, some wild contrast AND colour would look pretty great, too :)  As it is, your subject and background are kind of battling each other for attention - and this is a better shot than that!  Good luck, this is a nice action capture.', '2005-10-25 01:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809348, 247606, 16790, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how others are going to feel about this, since it doesn''t really seem to be your standard DPC fair, but I love it - it''s very abstract feeling, and it definitely meets the challenge.  Good call going with b&amp;w on this, and I like the out of focus feel - great work!</td>', 'I''m not sure how others are going to feel about this, since it doesn''t really seem to be your standard DPC fair, but I love it - it''s very abstract feeling, and it definitely meets the challenge.  Good call going with b&w on this, and I like the out of focus feel - great work!', '2005-10-25 01:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809349, 248115, 7743, '<td valign="top">Noise isn''t all that attractive especially when applied to the extreme.  One way to make it more pleasing is to copy the background layer, apply a Gaussian blur and then blend the layers with colour.  This converts the noise to black and white making it more like film grain.<br/> <br/>Applying a little less noise and using the Gaussian blur technique could have made this image work.  As it is I feel it''s been over done.</td>', 'Noise isn''t all that attractive especially when applied to the extreme.  One way to make it more pleasing is to copy the background layer, apply a Gaussian blur and then blend the layers with colour.  This converts the noise to black and white making it more like film grain. Applying a little less noise and using the Gaussian blur technique could have made this image work.  As it is I feel it''s been over done.', '2005-10-25 01:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809353, 248040, 40873, '<td valign="top">that is an amazing photo. well done. you don''t need to worry about christmas cards this year!</td>', 'that is an amazing photo. well done. you don''t need to worry about christmas cards this year!', '2005-10-25 01:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809354, 248344, 27164, '<td valign="top">Good shot, however it appears that color noise was added to a B/W photo.  Perhaps you should have desaturated after adding the noise?  It''s quite distracting.</td>', 'Good shot, however it appears that color noise was added to a B/W photo.  Perhaps you should have desaturated after adding the noise?  It''s quite distracting.', '2005-10-25 01:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
