(1809394, 248464, 10268, '<td valign="top">I definitely don''t think the noise enhances this shot in any way.  It''s actually really distracting, which is the first I''ve come across after nearly 100 shots I''ve voted on.  I really, really love grain and noise, but I just honestly don''t think it works here.  But man, you have a stellar shot otherwise.  7.</td>', 'I definitely don''t think the noise enhances this shot in any way.  It''s actually really distracting, which is the first I''ve come across after nearly 100 shots I''ve voted on.  I really, really love grain and noise, but I just honestly don''t think it works here.  But man, you have a stellar shot otherwise.  7.', '2005-10-25 02:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
