(1809735, 246709, 36988, '<td valign="top">My favorite for this challenge, loved it! 9</td>', 'My favorite for this challenge, loved it! 9', '2005-10-25 08:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809739, 247606, 45598, '<td valign="top">This grain works very well with the subject matter.</td>', 'This grain works very well with the subject matter.', '2005-10-25 08:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809742, 247696, 36988, '<td valign="top">Love the way the grain enhances this image instead of just being there because of the challenge.  In this case grain is important to the feel of the shot.</td>', 'Love the way the grain enhances this image instead of just being there because of the challenge.  In this case grain is important to the feel of the shot.', '2005-10-25 09:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809744, 247981, 36988, '<td valign="top">Grain here only enhances the mood I assume you were trying to convey, that of a young rebel, well done.</td>', 'Grain here only enhances the mood I assume you were trying to convey, that of a young rebel, well done.', '2005-10-25 09:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809745, 248419, 45598, '<td valign="top">Like your literal interpretation.</td>', 'Like your literal interpretation.', '2005-10-25 09:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809746, 246924, 36988, '<td valign="top">You have done it!  You have used grain to improve your shot, love it.</td>', 'You have done it!  You have used grain to improve your shot, love it.', '2005-10-25 09:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809747, 247980, 36988, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2005-10-25 09:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809748, 247684, 36988, '<td valign="top">A very moody picture which grain only enhances.</td>', 'A very moody picture which grain only enhances.', '2005-10-25 09:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809750, 248345, 34192, '<td valign="top">This image amuses me.  I like the immediacy of it.  Too bad he wasn''t picking his nose.  I think the grain works beautifully.  9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This image amuses me.  I like the immediacy of it.  Too bad he wasn''t picking his nose.  I think the grain works beautifully.  9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-10-25 09:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809751, 245496, 34192, '<td valign="top">I haven''t figured out yet what it is, but something about this image intrigues me.  I think it must be the red.  I think the composition is wonderful.  I might clone out the shadow at the bottom right, but I might also leave it in.  Naah, I''d take it out.  9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I haven''t figured out yet what it is, but something about this image intrigues me.  I think it must be the red.  I think the composition is wonderful.  I might clone out the shadow at the bottom right, but I might also leave it in.  Naah, I''d take it out.  9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-10-25 09:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809752, 248344, 36199, '<td valign="top">Good use of geain to create atmosphere</td>', 'Good use of geain to create atmosphere', '2005-10-25 09:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809754, 246890, 7560, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the grain here looks more like noise than grain. Which I''m sure makes no sense. :) Hmmm, okay, better explination. The sky noise/grain stands out in a way that is visually unappealing. I''m thinking it''s a color conversion issue. Possibly a different quadtone conversion would give the same impact....wait, just figured it out. There''s a bit of a hint of the green in the sky noise. This makes it less grainy and more noisy...and you are still looking at me like I''m smoking crack. Sorry. :) 6</td>', 'Good idea, but the grain here looks more like noise than grain. Which I''m sure makes no sense. :) Hmmm, okay, better explination. The sky noise/grain stands out in a way that is visually unappealing. I''m thinking it''s a color conversion issue. Possibly a different quadtone conversion would give the same impact....wait, just figured it out. There''s a bit of a hint of the green in the sky noise. This makes it less grainy and more noisy...and you are still looking at me like I''m smoking crack. Sorry. :) 6', '2005-10-25 09:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809756, 247888, 34192, '<td valign="top">Of all the people shots, this is my favorite.  The movement flows so well with the grain, I can actually see the continuation of where they were going, what they were doing. Love the composition and the juxtaposition.  Hate the title - for me it doesn''t fit.  OH well. 9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Of all the people shots, this is my favorite.  The movement flows so well with the grain, I can actually see the continuation of where they were going, what they were doing. Love the composition and the juxtaposition.  Hate the title - for me it doesn''t fit.  OH well. 9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-10-25 09:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809758, 248235, 36988, '<td valign="top">The grain works well here to further enhance the mood, well done.</td>', 'The grain works well here to further enhance the mood, well done.', '2005-10-25 09:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809760, 246927, 7560, '<td valign="top">Not something that works for me asthetically. It''s very, very overly processed. But, it does hit the challenge square on the head. The image is enhanced by the grain. 7</td>', 'Not something that works for me asthetically. It''s very, very overly processed. But, it does hit the challenge square on the head. The image is enhanced by the grain. 7', '2005-10-25 09:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809761, 248491, 36199, '<td valign="top">this image has captured the dark seedy feel of the back street, makes you wonder what is round the corner.--good one</td>', 'this image has captured the dark seedy feel of the back street, makes you wonder what is round the corner.--good one', '2005-10-25 09:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809763, 248176, 34192, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling this may not be well received.  Its a shame.    This image is made by its mood - something serene and yet, at the same time, sad.  I have similar images but you have taken it one step further.  Kudos - 9 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I have a feeling this may not be well received.  Its a shame.    This image is made by its mood - something serene and yet, at the same time, sad.  I have similar images but you have taken it one step further.  Kudos - 9 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-10-25 09:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809764, 247494, 7560, '<td valign="top">This has a great 50s feel to it. The grain is almost too subtle here. That keeps it just shy of and 8. Nice pose, great pensive look. 7</td>', 'This has a great 50s feel to it. The grain is almost too subtle here. That keeps it just shy of and 8. Nice pose, great pensive look. 7', '2005-10-25 09:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809766, 247337, 36988, '<td valign="top">I think you have used grain to achieve a moodiness to this picture and it has worked well for you.  Great to see shots that use grain to enhance a feeling.<br/>Well done.</td>', 'I think you have used grain to achieve a moodiness to this picture and it has worked well for you.  Great to see shots that use grain to enhance a feeling.Well done.', '2005-10-25 09:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809768, 248439, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This is beautiful.  Wish you had pulled him just slightly more off center - it would add tension to the image.  Love the colors and the tones. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Wow.  This is beautiful.  Wish you had pulled him just slightly more off center - it would add tension to the image.  Love the colors and the tones. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-10-25 09:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809772, 247720, 36199, '<td valign="top">a good ''art'' shot, plenty of atmosphere</td>', 'a good ''art'' shot, plenty of atmosphere', '2005-10-25 09:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809773, 248192, 34192, '<td valign="top">for me, the composition is this image''s strength - its beautifully composed.  The toning is excellent. 8 - good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'for me, the composition is this image''s strength - its beautifully composed.  The toning is excellent. 8 - good luck in the challenge!', '2005-10-25 09:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809775, 247933, 34192, '<td valign="top">priceless expression.  The grain adds.  One of the better people shots.  Well done!</td>', 'priceless expression.  The grain adds.  One of the better people shots.  Well done!', '2005-10-25 09:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809776, 248081, 7560, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. The grain is very subtle, but there. It almost shouldn''t quite work. But it does make me start thinking art deco. Which evokes the mood, which is part of what makes grain cool. :) The crane to the left is a smidge distracting and might benifit from cropping out. Otherwise, very neat image. 7</td>', 'Interesting shot. The grain is very subtle, but there. It almost shouldn''t quite work. But it does make me start thinking art deco. Which evokes the mood, which is part of what makes grain cool. :) The crane to the left is a smidge distracting and might benifit from cropping out. Otherwise, very neat image. 7', '2005-10-25 09:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809778, 247521, 36988, '<td valign="top">very artistic shot</td>', 'very artistic shot', '2005-10-25 09:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809780, 246279, 7560, '<td valign="top">Friday Night Lights. :) (Sorry, American football reference there). The horizon is tilted a bit to the right, and I''d pull the image down a bit (less foreground, and more sky. Very nice.</td>', 'Friday Night Lights. :) (Sorry, American football reference there). The horizon is tilted a bit to the right, and I''d pull the image down a bit (less foreground, and more sky. Very nice.', '2005-10-25 09:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809781, 248270, 36988, '<td valign="top">Nicely done</td>', 'Nicely done', '2005-10-25 09:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809782, 248389, 7560, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of color grain. This is a hard thing to do. Your color enhances the shot, and the grain makes you think of age, with is an excellent contrast to the softer feel of the leaves. 8</td>', 'Excellent use of color grain. This is a hard thing to do. Your color enhances the shot, and the grain makes you think of age, with is an excellent contrast to the softer feel of the leaves. 8', '2005-10-25 09:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809783, 248419, 7560, '<td valign="top">The ultimate expression of this challenge. :)</td>', 'The ultimate expression of this challenge. :)', '2005-10-25 09:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809784, 248389, 36988, '<td valign="top">Love the use of selective desat, in combination with the grain it is very effectve.</td>', 'Love the use of selective desat, in combination with the grain it is very effectve.', '2005-10-25 09:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809787, 248051, 36988, '<td valign="top">definately used grain to enhance the mood, good capture.</td>', 'definately used grain to enhance the mood, good capture.', '2005-10-25 09:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809791, 248004, 36988, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of grain to imply decay, I like this shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting use of grain to imply decay, I like this shot.  Good luck.', '2005-10-25 09:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809797, 247361, 7560, '<td valign="top">This one interests me. You can see the grain present in the sky, and on the dolphins, but the dolphins themselves have such a sleek appearence that the noise on them is less obvious. It makes for a very nice visual contrast. And good use of negative space. 7</td>', 'This one interests me. You can see the grain present in the sky, and on the dolphins, but the dolphins themselves have such a sleek appearence that the noise on them is less obvious. It makes for a very nice visual contrast. And good use of negative space. 7', '2005-10-25 09:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809799, 247704, 7560, '<td valign="top">Great image, needs a better title. :)</td>', 'Great image, needs a better title. :)', '2005-10-25 09:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809806, 247596, 36988, '<td valign="top">This is a very grainy shot and I love it!  This is my second view and am moving it up from a 6 to a 9.</td>', 'This is a very grainy shot and I love it!  This is my second view and am moving it up from a 6 to a 9.', '2005-10-25 09:34:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1809807, 245296, 7560, '<td valign="top">Extreme grain and noise along with extreme color processing. Interesting, and a cool visual abstract.</td>', 'Extreme grain and noise along with extreme color processing. Interesting, and a cool visual abstract.', '2005-10-25 09:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809808, 247662, 39821, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky thet evening.  Kool grainy ''37 Ford.</td>', 'Beautiful sky thet evening.  Kool grainy ''37 Ford.', '2005-10-25 09:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809809, 246890, 36988, '<td valign="top">Well done!</td>', 'Well done!', '2005-10-25 09:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809810, 246835, 7560, '<td valign="top">Great non conventional portrait here. I love the tones and contrast.</td>', 'Great non conventional portrait here. I love the tones and contrast.', '2005-10-25 09:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809811, 248436, 36988, '<td valign="top">Perfect for grain, well done.</td>', 'Perfect for grain, well done.', '2005-10-25 09:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809814, 246836, 36988, '<td valign="top">Grain enhances the mood here, well done.</td>', 'Grain enhances the mood here, well done.', '2005-10-25 09:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809815, 248479, 7560, '<td valign="top">Great use of negative space and subtle grain. Nice contrasts here in color.</td>', 'Great use of negative space and subtle grain. Nice contrasts here in color.', '2005-10-25 09:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809817, 248344, 7560, '<td valign="top">Piano bar, dark, late night, hours of smoke hanging heavy in the air...who''s he playing for? Ella? I can hear the subtle strains of "At Last" coming through the monitor...9</td>', 'Piano bar, dark, late night, hours of smoke hanging heavy in the air...who''s he playing for? Ella? I can hear the subtle strains of "At Last" coming through the monitor...9', '2005-10-25 09:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809818, 248447, 36988, '<td valign="top">A good subject for this challenge, nicely done.</td>', 'A good subject for this challenge, nicely done.', '2005-10-25 09:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809821, 248422, 36988, '<td valign="top">A great example of how grain can enhance a mood.</td>', 'A great example of how grain can enhance a mood.', '2005-10-25 09:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809823, 246685, 7560, '<td valign="top">I like this. I like the impact the grian gives to the image. Only thing I don''t like is the extra bit a the top. It''s pulling me away from the two main subjects and the contrast of the colors against the wall. 7</td>', 'I like this. I like the impact the grian gives to the image. Only thing I don''t like is the extra bit a the top. It''s pulling me away from the two main subjects and the contrast of the colors against the wall. 7', '2005-10-25 09:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809824, 248124, 7560, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot here, but a lack of grain adding impact. I particularly like the well defined jagged edges of the leaf as they contrast with the background.</td>', 'Beautiful shot here, but a lack of grain adding impact. I particularly like the well defined jagged edges of the leaf as they contrast with the background.', '2005-10-25 09:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809827, 247980, 7560, '<td valign="top">I''m having an X-Files moment here. Cool spotlighting effect.</td>', 'I''m having an X-Files moment here. Cool spotlighting effect.', '2005-10-25 09:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809828, 248257, 7560, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites for the challenge. I love the feeling of the dust still settling around the skull. Subtle grain that adds texture and a feeling of grit to the shot. 10</td>', 'This is one of my favorites for the challenge. I love the feeling of the dust still settling around the skull. Subtle grain that adds texture and a feeling of grit to the shot. 10', '2005-10-25 09:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809830, 247596, 46177, '<td valign="top">I really love this shot.  You were obviously not afraid to use grain and I think it worked well.  You can almost feel the brittleness of the fallen branches.  I hope you do well in this challenge, I think you should.</td>', 'I really love this shot.  You were obviously not afraid to use grain and I think it worked well.  You can almost feel the brittleness of the fallen branches.  I hope you do well in this challenge, I think you should.', '2005-10-25 09:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809831, 248389, 46177, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!</td>', 'Cool shot!', '2005-10-25 09:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809832, 248422, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great picture! Love the expression and Title fits perfect. The grain really adds to the feel of this. Nice capture. The only 10 I saw!</td>', 'Wow! Great picture! Love the expression and Title fits perfect. The grain really adds to the feel of this. Nice capture. The only 10 I saw!', '2005-10-25 09:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809833, 247305, 46177, '<td valign="top">A rose with grain, who would have thought this would work, but it does. The colour choice helps as well.</td>', 'A rose with grain, who would have thought this would work, but it does. The colour choice helps as well.', '2005-10-25 09:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809834, 246521, 42638, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Love the gradual fade from gray to black. Nice use of space.</td>', 'Very nice! Love the gradual fade from gray to black. Nice use of space.', '2005-10-25 09:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809836, 247929, 42638, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. Love the capture of stars there. Really adds to the picture.</td>', 'Nice picture. Love the capture of stars there. Really adds to the picture.', '2005-10-25 09:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809837, 248410, 42638, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Love the antiquity of this shot.</td>', 'Nicely done. Love the antiquity of this shot.', '2005-10-25 09:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809839, 248175, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, interesting shot. nice timing on this rose.</td>', 'Wow, interesting shot. nice timing on this rose.', '2005-10-25 09:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809840, 248418, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. Love the old and odd subject. Nice use of space.</td>', 'Interesting picture. Love the old and odd subject. Nice use of space.', '2005-10-25 09:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809844, 248081, 46177, '<td valign="top">The grain helps to give this image a feeling of not only a bygone era but desolation. I have looked a couple of times and in my opinion I think you have succeeded in what you intended to capture.</td>', 'The grain helps to give this image a feeling of not only a bygone era but desolation. I have looked a couple of times and in my opinion I think you have succeeded in what you intended to capture.', '2005-10-25 09:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809846, 247483, 46177, '<td valign="top">Nice feeling here, makes me want to walk in the rain.</td>', 'Nice feeling here, makes me want to walk in the rain.', '2005-10-25 09:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809848, 246707, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. very desolate. The grain just seems to mask and gray it out. I don''t see it adding to it.</td>', 'Interesting picture. very desolate. The grain just seems to mask and gray it out. I don''t see it adding to it.', '2005-10-25 09:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809849, 246813, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. the colors seem off a bit.</td>', 'Interesting picture. the colors seem off a bit.', '2005-10-25 09:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809851, 245931, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks like a nice picture but its a bit too small to appreciate better.</td>', 'Wow, looks like a nice picture but its a bit too small to appreciate better.', '2005-10-25 09:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809855, 248386, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. Seems like the exposure is a bit off though.</td>', 'Interesting picture. Seems like the exposure is a bit off though.', '2005-10-25 09:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809859, 248115, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks like this was a nice picture but a bit too much noise. It really distorts and doesn''t add to it.</td>', 'Wow, looks like this was a nice picture but a bit too much noise. It really distorts and doesn''t add to it.', '2005-10-25 09:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809864, 247521, 42638, '<td valign="top">interesting picture, almost ghost like. The swirl on the upper left really pulls from the subject. like the concept.</td>', 'interesting picture, almost ghost like. The swirl on the upper left really pulls from the subject. like the concept.', '2005-10-25 10:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809867, 246924, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. Don''t understand the title with it but like the grain with the horse.</td>', 'Interesting picture. Don''t understand the title with it but like the grain with the horse.', '2005-10-25 10:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1809869, 248247, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. Looks like its an old photo.</td>', 'Interesting picture. Looks like its an old photo.', '2005-10-25 10:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
