(1809893, 248372, 38234, '<td valign="top">this is a great portrait, however I think it wold look much better without grain and can''t see how it''s been enhanced with it added</td>', 'this is a great portrait, however I think it wold look much better without grain and can''t see how it''s been enhanced with it added', '2005-10-25 10:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
