(1810087, 247649, 44860, '<td valign="top">Very sad, melancholic horse. It is not easy to make grain work for you, but as I realized while casting votes, sometimes it makes a photo look more artistic, not documentary. It is like a prior notice: hey, look for a message, or mood, I''m going to tell you something. And this is why I love a mood of the horse, and it''s not important, what are its nutrition preferences.</td>', 'Very sad, melancholic horse. It is not easy to make grain work for you, but as I realized while casting votes, sometimes it makes a photo look more artistic, not documentary. It is like a prior notice: hey, look for a message, or mood, I''m going to tell you something. And this is why I love a mood of the horse, and it''s not important, what are its nutrition preferences.', '2005-10-25 11:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1810099, 247365, 44860, '<td valign="top">No grain here. It is really essential to meet a theme of a challenge. Otherwise we will have a huge heap of nice unsorted photos.</td>', 'No grain here. It is really essential to meet a theme of a challenge. Otherwise we will have a huge heap of nice unsorted photos.', '2005-10-25 11:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
