(1811782, 248422, 14211, '<td valign="top">Love this face.....hate seeing it sad for any reason....wonderful  drama and super use of Grain.........wish I could vote .wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwW</td>', 'Love this face.....hate seeing it sad for any reason....wonderful  drama and super use of Grain.........wish I could vote .wwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwW', '2005-10-25 19:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1811788, 248051, 25655, '<td valign="top">hehehe a <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/portfolio.php?USER_ID=25655&amp;collection_id=10626" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">dead man walking</a>... (sorry about the self promotion)<br/>Excellent shot. I love the light on it, and I think the grain makes it a lot stronger emotivly. 10 and favorite.</td>', 'hehehe a dead man walking... (sorry about the self promotion)Excellent shot. I love the light on it, and I think the grain makes it a lot stronger emotivly. 10 and favorite.', '2005-10-25 19:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1811798, 246924, 25655, '<td valign="top">hehehe a <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/portfolio.php?USER_ID=25655&amp;collection_id=10626" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">dead man walking</a>... (sorry about the self promotion)<br/>Wonderful shot. The harsh grain works great here and so is the sepia tone. <br/>I would try to burn the car at the background just a little so it doesn''t attract so much of the attention from the foreground. 9</td>', 'hehehe a dead man walking... (sorry about the self promotion)Wonderful shot. The harsh grain works great here and so is the sepia tone. I would try to burn the car at the background just a little so it doesn''t attract so much of the attention from the foreground. 9', '2005-10-25 19:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
