(1811898, 248244, 35218, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Looks a bit too posterised to me - almost like a charcoal drawing.  I guess that''s the intention in which case very well done indeed.  Just not very appealing to my personal taste. 7</td>', 'Nice shot.  Looks a bit too posterised to me - almost like a charcoal drawing.  I guess that''s the intention in which case very well done indeed.  Just not very appealing to my personal taste. 7', '2005-10-25 20:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
