(1811907, 247331, 35218, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Grain is very subtle (very subtle).  Feels like something onut of the 1970s if it weren;t for the modern looking cars.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice.  Grain is very subtle (very subtle).  Feels like something onut of the 1970s if it weren;t for the modern looking cars.  Well done.', '2005-10-25 20:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
