(1812337, 248447, 25397, '<td valign="top">Very striking portrait, I love his tilt away from the frame to expose the gun.<br/> <br/>I would like to see the grain less evenly spread out, you can do this on a seperate layer with eraser brush here and there, it looks too photoshopped.<br/> <br/>I''m thinking this comes from selzter''s line of portraits from his portrait project, but if I am wrong take it as a compliment... It''s a wonderful series!<br/> <br/>-Joey</td>', 'Very striking portrait, I love his tilt away from the frame to expose the gun. I would like to see the grain less evenly spread out, you can do this on a seperate layer with eraser brush here and there, it looks too photoshopped. I''m thinking this comes from selzter''s line of portraits from his portrait project, but if I am wrong take it as a compliment... It''s a wonderful series! -Joey', '2005-10-25 23:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
