(1812625, 248444, 36299, '<td valign="top">The overall effect is nice, although the grain does not ad as much as the rest of the process that gave this picture its earthy tonality.  The only change I would make is t ensure that the grain was the same colour as its surrounding environment.  That is the problem of digital grain that is not present in film grain.</td>', 'The overall effect is nice, although the grain does not ad as much as the rest of the process that gave this picture its earthy tonality.  The only change I would make is t ensure that the grain was the same colour as its surrounding environment.  That is the problem of digital grain that is not present in film grain.', '2005-10-26 00:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1812630, 246488, 36299, '<td valign="top">The overall effect is nice, although the grain does not ad as much as the rest of the process that gave this picture its earthy tonality.  The only change I would make is t ensure that the grain was the same colour as its surrounding environment.  That is the problem of digital grain that is not present in film grain.</td>', 'The overall effect is nice, although the grain does not ad as much as the rest of the process that gave this picture its earthy tonality.  The only change I would make is t ensure that the grain was the same colour as its surrounding environment.  That is the problem of digital grain that is not present in film grain.', '2005-10-26 00:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
