(1812661, 247722, 13688, '<td valign="top">i like how the flag and one way sign mimic each other.  i''m having alot of trouble with the rest of your composition.  the next most interesting thing for me are the lights but the one set seems too high in the frame.  what i assume is your major point of interest is out of focus and seems to only take away from the feeling of completely desolate streets which normally would be crowed, which i''m inferring was your intent.  also the bottom right object seems unwarented.  your shot did grab my attention, sorry for being so critical of your work.</td>', 'i like how the flag and one way sign mimic each other.  i''m having alot of trouble with the rest of your composition.  the next most interesting thing for me are the lights but the one set seems too high in the frame.  what i assume is your major point of interest is out of focus and seems to only take away from the feeling of completely desolate streets which normally would be crowed, which i''m inferring was your intent.  also the bottom right object seems unwarented.  your shot did grab my attention, sorry for being so critical of your work.', '2005-10-26 00:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1812680, 248175, 13688, '<td valign="top">though interesting, the strong coloring of the bg flowers takes away from the gritiness i would associate with a grain challenge. they also steal some of the show from your main object.  i''m thinking black and white would help make this a stronger entry for this challenge</td>', 'though interesting, the strong coloring of the bg flowers takes away from the gritiness i would associate with a grain challenge. they also steal some of the show from your main object.  i''m thinking black and white would help make this a stronger entry for this challenge', '2005-10-26 00:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1812693, 248126, 13688, '<td valign="top">amazing facial expression.  so wish the helping hand was not there</td>', 'amazing facial expression.  so wish the helping hand was not there', '2005-10-26 00:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1812696, 245871, 19952, '<td valign="top">Great tones and colors and an excellent choice of subject for this challenge. Nicely done.</td>', 'Great tones and colors and an excellent choice of subject for this challenge. Nicely done.', '2005-10-26 00:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1812739, 248387, 13688, '<td valign="top">your shot has some very interesting geometries for me.  The woman in the forground and the feet in the background with the crosswalk lines have intriguing shapes.  overall i would have wished you waited a bit for "the" shot.  his open hand seems awkward and the bottle is a major distraction  also he seems a bit too close to the top and him merging with the walker to me isn''t a good thing compositionally either.  sorry for being critical.</td>', 'your shot has some very interesting geometries for me.  The woman in the forground and the feet in the background with the crosswalk lines have intriguing shapes.  overall i would have wished you waited a bit for "the" shot.  his open hand seems awkward and the bottle is a major distraction  also he seems a bit too close to the top and him merging with the walker to me isn''t a good thing compositionally either.  sorry for being critical.', '2005-10-26 00:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
