(1814397, 247934, 35602, '<td valign="top">Image is really out of focus.  Would have been sharper if you used a tripod.  Also, a bit more brightness would have shown more grain.</td>', 'Image is really out of focus.  Would have been sharper if you used a tripod.  Also, a bit more brightness would have shown more grain.', '2005-10-26 12:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
