(1814420, 248483, 35602, '<td valign="top">Lots of good grain.  Placement of footprints are good compositionally.  Overall I didn''t find the image all that interesting.</td>', 'Lots of good grain.  Placement of footprints are good compositionally.  Overall I didn''t find the image all that interesting.', '2005-10-26 12:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1814434, 247994, 35602, '<td valign="top">Though you depicted grain, I look at the image and think that the grain was added just to meet the challenge.  As a photo I think that the grain doesn''t do anything for the image,</td>', 'Though you depicted grain, I look at the image and think that the grain was added just to meet the challenge.  As a photo I think that the grain doesn''t do anything for the image,', '2005-10-26 12:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1814442, 248479, 35602, '<td valign="top">Needed to focus better.  The image would not have been wrecked either if you cropped more out of it.  By zooming in in editing, say the center to the right of the image, it would have created more grain and been a better image.</td>', 'Needed to focus better.  The image would not have been wrecked either if you cropped more out of it.  By zooming in in editing, say the center to the right of the image, it would have created more grain and been a better image.', '2005-10-26 12:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1814450, 247974, 35602, '<td valign="top">Definitely is grainy.  Overall, the image seemed to be lacking something, not sure what.  Maybe less grain would have enhanced the contours of the statue better without overwhelming it.</td>', 'Definitely is grainy.  Overall, the image seemed to be lacking something, not sure what.  Maybe less grain would have enhanced the contours of the statue better without overwhelming it.', '2005-10-26 12:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1814458, 247522, 35602, '<td valign="top">The blue eyes are disturbing.</td>', 'The blue eyes are disturbing.', '2005-10-26 12:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1814474, 247979, 35602, '<td valign="top">I had a real problem with all the artifacts in the images.  With this image, I think that selective sharpening of the background only would have added the grain that you needed, and I would have left the roses alone.  Then they would pop out from the background, giving a more pleasing image.</td>', 'I had a real problem with all the artifacts in the images.  With this image, I think that selective sharpening of the background only would have added the grain that you needed, and I would have left the roses alone.  Then they would pop out from the background, giving a more pleasing image.', '2005-10-26 12:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1814484, 248505, 35602, '<td valign="top">Would have liked more brightness on the image, which would have given it more grain.  The most noticeable part of the image is the roof, which is very broken up with digital shadow.  In advanced editing you can selectively choose to sharpen or blur areas.  More editing would have helped this image.</td>', 'Would have liked more brightness on the image, which would have given it more grain.  The most noticeable part of the image is the roof, which is very broken up with digital shadow.  In advanced editing you can selectively choose to sharpen or blur areas.  More editing would have helped this image.', '2005-10-26 12:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1814488, 245847, 35602, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little too dark?  Also thought the subject wasn''t all that interesting, though you did place a lot of grain in the image.  Good choice to make the image brown toned.</td>', 'Maybe a little too dark?  Also thought the subject wasn''t all that interesting, though you did place a lot of grain in the image.  Good choice to make the image brown toned.', '2005-10-26 12:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1814562, 247492, 46510, '<td valign="top">I really liked this photograph.  The grain doesn''t seemed forced-in to comply with the challenge, it looks as though it belongs.  The horizon line splits the image straight down the middle and yet the two opposing focal points placed close to the edge create a very interesting dynamic that keeps the eye moving.</td>', 'I really liked this photograph.  The grain doesn''t seemed forced-in to comply with the challenge, it looks as though it belongs.  The horizon line splits the image straight down the middle and yet the two opposing focal points placed close to the edge create a very interesting dynamic that keeps the eye moving.', '2005-10-26 12:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1814576, 247656, 46510, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice high key image, but I did keep coming up against the left border which the boat seems to be moving towards.  Otherwise, the grain looks as though it belongs and the simplicity of the image is very appealing.</td>', 'This is a really nice high key image, but I did keep coming up against the left border which the boat seems to be moving towards.  Otherwise, the grain looks as though it belongs and the simplicity of the image is very appealing.', '2005-10-26 12:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1814598, 248441, 35739, '<td valign="top">I like the look of this.  Has that painting look.</td>', 'I like the look of this.  Has that painting look.', '2005-10-26 12:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
