(1814820, 248217, 37719, '<td valign="top">Where is the image grain?  The photo looks clear and free from grain/noise of any kind.</td>', 'Where is the image grain?  The photo looks clear and free from grain/noise of any kind.', '2005-10-26 14:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1814823, 248524, 37719, '<td valign="top">Interesting portrait and well done in black and white.  Good control of reflection in the glasses.  However, I just don''t see image grain in the photo.</td>', 'Interesting portrait and well done in black and white.  Good control of reflection in the glasses.  However, I just don''t see image grain in the photo.', '2005-10-26 14:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1814828, 248103, 37719, '<td valign="top">Where is the image grain?  I just don''t see it.  I see a lot of texture on the hills in the background due to trees, but no grain.  This is a nice image. I think with slightly different processing this would be a strong image.</td>', 'Where is the image grain?  I just don''t see it.  I see a lot of texture on the hills in the background due to trees, but no grain.  This is a nice image. I think with slightly different processing this would be a strong image.', '2005-10-26 14:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1814830, 248527, 37719, '<td valign="top">Where is the image grain?  Not sure how I feel about this image.  I have tried to see grain, but fail to.  However, the image seems to keep me returning for another look.</td>', 'Where is the image grain?  Not sure how I feel about this image.  I have tried to see grain, but fail to.  However, the image seems to keep me returning for another look.', '2005-10-26 14:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1814851, 245995, 20941, '<td valign="top">excellent use of grain to enhance the mood and look of this image. Very nice work!</td>', 'excellent use of grain to enhance the mood and look of this image. Very nice work!', '2005-10-26 14:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815083, 248491, 46510, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  I don''t see grain working in many colour images, but this is an example of one where it really does.</td>', 'This is nice.  I don''t see grain working in many colour images, but this is an example of one where it really does.', '2005-10-26 15:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815089, 246933, 46510, '<td valign="top">No you can''t.  And I couldn''t ignore your image either.  Nice one.</td>', 'No you can''t.  And I couldn''t ignore your image either.  Nice one.', '2005-10-26 15:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815103, 245970, 46510, '<td valign="top">Perhaps this image could be improved by having a more definite focal point.  The tree frames and the diagonals lead... but nowhere really.</td>', 'Perhaps this image could be improved by having a more definite focal point.  The tree frames and the diagonals lead... but nowhere really.', '2005-10-26 15:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815130, 248364, 46510, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2005-10-26 15:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815140, 248377, 46510, '<td valign="top">If the focal point of the image is really just the colours then maybe you could add impact by really saturating the color, and perhaps making creative use of blur.  Otherwise the results can be a little bit boring.</td>', 'If the focal point of the image is really just the colours then maybe you could add impact by really saturating the color, and perhaps making creative use of blur.  Otherwise the results can be a little bit boring.', '2005-10-26 15:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815164, 248155, 46510, '<td valign="top">This is a study in simplicity.  Very beautiful.</td>', 'This is a study in simplicity.  Very beautiful.', '2005-10-26 15:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815191, 247311, 46510, '<td valign="top">The strong grain and contrast makes this image for me.  The image seems to be built around the grain rather than simply adding it as an after thought.</td>', 'The strong grain and contrast makes this image for me.  The image seems to be built around the grain rather than simply adding it as an after thought.', '2005-10-26 15:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815210, 248467, 46510, '<td valign="top">There''s a nice harmony and dynamic between the two elements of this image that moves your eye constantly from one to the other.  The strong grain adds interest.  Nice.</td>', 'There''s a nice harmony and dynamic between the two elements of this image that moves your eye constantly from one to the other.  The strong grain adds interest.  Nice.', '2005-10-26 15:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815216, 248246, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nice. Maybe it would have looked better in sepia or B/W, but the shot is very well composed.</td>', 'Nice. Maybe it would have looked better in sepia or B/W, but the shot is very well composed.', '2005-10-26 15:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815228, 247361, 46510, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot! The grain does seem to have been added as a bit of an after thought though - but  the picture is a definite keeper.</td>', 'This is a fantastic shot! The grain does seem to have been added as a bit of an after thought though - but  the picture is a definite keeper.', '2005-10-26 15:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815234, 247483, 41554, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. However I doubt that it benefits from grain at all. IMHO grain works best with greater DOF. But the shot is nice anyway.</td>', 'Nice shot. However I doubt that it benefits from grain at all. IMHO grain works best with greater DOF. But the shot is nice anyway.', '2005-10-26 16:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815238, 247868, 46510, '<td valign="top">Nice!  The variable grain applied naturally across shadows and highlights looks great.</td>', 'Nice!  The variable grain applied naturally across shadows and highlights looks great.', '2005-10-26 16:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815245, 246201, 46510, '<td valign="top">The beveled blurry white frame spoils this image for me.    But I like the photo.</td>', 'The beveled blurry white frame spoils this image for me.    But I like the photo.', '2005-10-26 16:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815249, 246765, 46510, '<td valign="top">This is an engaging image.  nice.</td>', 'This is an engaging image.  nice.', '2005-10-26 16:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815274, 248422, 46510, '<td valign="top">I think that this image would benefit from a more varied and natural looking grain.  There are Photoshop-actions to help achieve this.  If you look at the grain on a non-digital b+w print you''ll see that grain is not an even speckle spread over the image.   Spread evenly like this and grain tends to start looking like digital noise.  A stunning portrait though.</td>', 'I think that this image would benefit from a more varied and natural looking grain.  There are Photoshop-actions to help achieve this.  If you look at the grain on a non-digital b+w print you''ll see that grain is not an even speckle spread over the image.   Spread evenly like this and grain tends to start looking like digital noise.  A stunning portrait though.', '2005-10-26 16:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815282, 247974, 46510, '<td valign="top">This works!</td>', 'This works!', '2005-10-26 16:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815290, 246938, 46510, '<td valign="top">Removed unhelpful comment.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-11-12 13:21:37.</i></td>', 'Removed unhelpful comment.', '2005-10-26 16:15:08.000000', '2005-11-12 13:21:37.000000', 1);
