(1815670, 247656, 24454, '<td valign="top">THAT is one of my favorite photots ever!!!   Just a slight amount of grain  -- I might even like this better crystal clear without the grain -- but nothing could take away how much I like it.  10++   In fact. . .I''m adding this one to my favorites!</td>', 'THAT is one of my favorite photots ever!!!   Just a slight amount of grain  -- I might even like this better crystal clear without the grain -- but nothing could take away how much I like it.  10++   In fact. . .I''m adding this one to my favorites!', '2005-10-26 17:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1815674, 248290, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a cool photo!   I love the urban feel to this.   I think it would look great without the selective desat too -- maybe even better -- but I still love it in every way!   10</td>', 'What a cool photo!   I love the urban feel to this.   I think it would look great without the selective desat too -- maybe even better -- but I still love it in every way!   10', '2005-10-26 17:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
