(1816643, 246933, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good use of the grain/effect for this shot in the Challenge.  Do not like the ''forced title'' (agenda/political/etc).   ''Dirty scene'', for which the grain works well.  Criticism; besides the title (and I have chosen to disregard it), I think that the ''smoke'' billowing emphasized more, somehow, would have really made this shot have more impact.  Perhaps a slightly sharper (ground up) angle may have also made this better in my opinion.  Perhaps a tighter crop/different angle, if possible, especially as that ''swirly tower'' on the right adds interest, and pairs well with the ''shape'' of the smoke, etc.</td>', '7 - Good use of the grain/effect for this shot in the Challenge.  Do not like the ''forced title'' (agenda/political/etc).   ''Dirty scene'', for which the grain works well.  Criticism; besides the title (and I have chosen to disregard it), I think that the ''smoke'' billowing emphasized more, somehow, would have really made this shot have more impact.  Perhaps a slightly sharper (ground up) angle may have also made this better in my opinion.  Perhaps a tighter crop/different angle, if possible, especially as that ''swirly tower'' on the right adds interest, and pairs well with the ''shape'' of the smoke, etc.', '2005-10-26 23:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
