(1817119, 248393, 23913, '<td valign="top">i think this image is hurt by being grainy in color (would look great grainy in sepia or B&amp;W) but in color i can just tell this would be so much more dynamic with out the grain, or at least less grain...<br/> <br/>i think u didn''t over do it here u just picked the wrong tone to show it in....6</td>', 'i think this image is hurt by being grainy in color (would look great grainy in sepia or B&W) but in color i can just tell this would be so much more dynamic with out the grain, or at least less grain... i think u didn''t over do it here u just picked the wrong tone to show it in....6', '2005-10-27 02:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
