(1819410, 248444, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very nice angle of the roof.  The contrast against the roundness of the hill and the colorful trees makes this a pleasing image.  I love the way the grain was more heavily applied in the sky.</td>', 'Very nice angle of the roof.  The contrast against the roundness of the hill and the colorful trees makes this a pleasing image.  I love the way the grain was more heavily applied in the sky.', '2005-10-27 22:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1819429, 247649, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice pose of the horse.  The eye is very well detailed as is the nose.  I thought that the color of the horse and wall were too close, though.  Maybe less grain on one or the other would have separated the two better.</td>', 'Nice pose of the horse.  The eye is very well detailed as is the nose.  I thought that the color of the horse and wall were too close, though.  Maybe less grain on one or the other would have separated the two better.', '2005-10-27 22:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1819443, 247482, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very cute portrait.  There was some grain on this one, but any more would have just wrecked the image.</td>', 'Very cute portrait.  There was some grain on this one, but any more would have just wrecked the image.', '2005-10-27 22:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1819458, 247813, 35602, '<td valign="top">The grain in this image seemed to detract from the contrast and focus.  The composition didn''t really lend itself well to the use of grain.  Maybe cropping out the trees and sky to focus on the stone and grass would have made a better choice.</td>', 'The grain in this image seemed to detract from the contrast and focus.  The composition didn''t really lend itself well to the use of grain.  Maybe cropping out the trees and sky to focus on the stone and grass would have made a better choice.', '2005-10-27 22:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1819464, 246836, 35602, '<td valign="top">Great sky.  The crop is excellent, showing just enough of the boat to add impact.  Nice job.  The only thing is it seemed a little dark to me, but it may have gotten muddy if you lightened it up anymore.  Hard to say.</td>', 'Great sky.  The crop is excellent, showing just enough of the boat to add impact.  Nice job.  The only thing is it seemed a little dark to me, but it may have gotten muddy if you lightened it up anymore.  Hard to say.', '2005-10-27 22:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1819475, 247596, 35602, '<td valign="top">Really liked the painted look of this one.  The image has artifacts as part of the grain in the dried pine branch, but it works for this one.  It doesn''t always.  Nice grain treatment.</td>', 'Really liked the painted look of this one.  The image has artifacts as part of the grain in the dried pine branch, but it works for this one.  It doesn''t always.  Nice grain treatment.', '2005-10-27 22:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1819478, 247148, 35602, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  You did a really good job of making the eye and nose grain free, which helps to bring the photo alive.</td>', 'Great capture.  You did a really good job of making the eye and nose grain free, which helps to bring the photo alive.', '2005-10-27 22:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1819481, 247284, 35602, '<td valign="top">Found the image basically uninteresting.  You could have also gone further to add more grain without losing any of the image.</td>', 'Found the image basically uninteresting.  You could have also gone further to add more grain without losing any of the image.', '2005-10-27 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1819488, 248255, 35602, '<td valign="top">Thought the color could have been better on this one.  Needed more grain, too.  With selective sharpening you could have created a lot more grain in the midtones and shadows without losing the image.</td>', 'Thought the color could have been better on this one.  Needed more grain, too.  With selective sharpening you could have created a lot more grain in the midtones and shadows without losing the image.', '2005-10-27 22:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1819494, 248238, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very muddy image.  Nice stop motion, though.</td>', 'Very muddy image.  Nice stop motion, though.', '2005-10-27 22:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1819504, 248296, 35602, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit digitally broken up.  By creating grain, the resolution was compromised, so the image itself may not have been the best choice for a photo using image grain.</td>', 'Seems a bit digitally broken up.  By creating grain, the resolution was compromised, so the image itself may not have been the best choice for a photo using image grain.', '2005-10-27 22:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
