(1819525, 248356, 35602, '<td valign="top">Very intense.  Looks like your in the midst of a hurricaine.  Color treatment was a good choice.  Figure seems a bit broken up, though.  Anyway, overall the image was very powerful.</td>', 'Very intense.  Looks like your in the midst of a hurricaine.  Color treatment was a good choice.  Figure seems a bit broken up, though.  Anyway, overall the image was very powerful.', '2005-10-27 22:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
