(1819988, 247050, 39110, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, could have been improved by her eyes looking at the camera</td>', 'Nice photo, could have been improved by her eyes looking at the camera', '2005-10-28 01:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1819992, 248499, 36619, '<td valign="top">the grain in the picture really softens the dark severity of the model''s makeup. beautiful capture.</td>', 'the grain in the picture really softens the dark severity of the model''s makeup. beautiful capture.', '2005-10-28 01:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820100, 248224, 3214, '<td valign="top">Very nice, in all respects.</td>', 'Very nice, in all respects.', '2005-10-28 02:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820105, 248417, 3214, '<td valign="top">Like the high contrast, composition, your point of viw.  Oh, and the grain.  :-)</td>', 'Like the high contrast, composition, your point of viw.  Oh, and the grain.  :-)', '2005-10-28 02:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820110, 247933, 3214, '<td valign="top">Susi, your model is just too cool.  Nice work.</td>', 'Susi, your model is just too cool.  Nice work.', '2005-10-28 02:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820114, 248375, 3214, '<td valign="top">Oooh, this is fun.  Love all the textures.  And the toning too. Seriously good.</td>', 'Oooh, this is fun.  Love all the textures.  And the toning too. Seriously good.', '2005-10-28 02:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820128, 248441, 4226, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah I will leave my first comment about "tooo much grain"  looks like the photo is encarved in some wall rather than a 3-D person</td>', 'Oh yeah I will leave my first comment about "tooo much grain"  looks like the photo is encarved in some wall rather than a 3-D person', '2005-10-28 02:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820130, 248280, 4226, '<td valign="top">Great one !! looks like taken in 1950s</td>', 'Great one !! looks like taken in 1950s', '2005-10-28 02:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820132, 247506, 4226, '<td valign="top">sure thinking outside the box...</td>', 'sure thinking outside the box...', '2005-10-28 03:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820136, 248034, 4226, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Looks like a photo taken in 1950s. <br/>edited to add.. its such a lovely expression, looks like tears are about to come any second... love photo !!</td>', 'Great capture. Looks like a photo taken in 1950s. edited to add.. its such a lovely expression, looks like tears are about to come any second... love photo !!', '2005-10-28 03:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820202, 248130, 35602, '<td valign="top">The rays of light are a nice touch to the photo.  It is my favorite part of the image.  The foreground seems to be very distracting, though.  It also lacks focus especially on the background.  There is a lot of competition going on between the two parts of the picture which makes it difficult for the eye to rest on what should be a restful scene.  Maybe some sort of a polarizer would have balanced the strong lighting when you took the picture.</td>', 'The rays of light are a nice touch to the photo.  It is my favorite part of the image.  The foreground seems to be very distracting, though.  It also lacks focus especially on the background.  There is a lot of competition going on between the two parts of the picture which makes it difficult for the eye to rest on what should be a restful scene.  Maybe some sort of a polarizer would have balanced the strong lighting when you took the picture.', '2005-10-28 04:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820208, 245494, 35602, '<td valign="top">Compositionally, a wider angle might have helped to complete the waterfall, which seems to be screaming for more height.</td>', 'Compositionally, a wider angle might have helped to complete the waterfall, which seems to be screaming for more height.', '2005-10-28 04:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820211, 248364, 35602, '<td valign="top">Your contrast is good between the dark barkground and the grain in the tv picture.  The texture of the foreground is also done pretty well as an added compostitional point.  As a photo, I didn''t find it to be a really compelling image.</td>', 'Your contrast is good between the dark barkground and the grain in the tv picture.  The texture of the foreground is also done pretty well as an added compostitional point.  As a photo, I didn''t find it to be a really compelling image.', '2005-10-28 04:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820214, 247521, 35602, '<td valign="top">Really liked the ethereal quality of the picture.</td>', 'Really liked the ethereal quality of the picture.', '2005-10-28 04:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820218, 248528, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color.  Also found the strong light to be useful in creating the image.  Grain is well used, especially in the pink and purple tones.</td>', 'Nice use of color.  Also found the strong light to be useful in creating the image.  Grain is well used, especially in the pink and purple tones.', '2005-10-28 04:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820243, 247245, 29474, '<td valign="top">Everything about this is good ... except the neck. It seems to be too dark and out of context.</td>', 'Everything about this is good ... except the neck. It seems to be too dark and out of context.', '2005-10-28 04:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820245, 247534, 29474, '<td valign="top">This is very captivating.</td>', 'This is very captivating.', '2005-10-28 04:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820357, 247494, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is an unusual and very appealing portrait.  It''s a 100% convincing depiction of the emotion expressed in the title.  The composition, the crop, and the young man''s bereft expression (especially as it''s directed off-stage), all contribute to the success of the image, and so of course does the understated yet effective use of grain.  7</td>', 'This is an unusual and very appealing portrait.  It''s a 100% convincing depiction of the emotion expressed in the title.  The composition, the crop, and the young man''s bereft expression (especially as it''s directed off-stage), all contribute to the success of the image, and so of course does the understated yet effective use of grain.  7', '2005-10-28 06:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820366, 246960, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait of a terrific subject.  I think the use of grain is particularly effective, because it creates a ''painterly'' feel to the image which, combined with the simple woollen hat and tee shirt, somehow serves to accentuate the mesmerising eyes of the model.   7</td>', 'Very nice portrait of a terrific subject.  I think the use of grain is particularly effective, because it creates a ''painterly'' feel to the image which, combined with the simple woollen hat and tee shirt, somehow serves to accentuate the mesmerising eyes of the model.   7', '2005-10-28 06:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820372, 248482, 46510, '<td valign="top">I find that the grain detracts here from an otherwise fantastic image.  The grain is starting to look a bit like unwanted noise... There are photoshop-actions available on the internet that can help in applying grain to an image in a way that creates a much more varied (between the highlights and shadows), natural looking result.</td>', 'I find that the grain detracts here from an otherwise fantastic image.  The grain is starting to look a bit like unwanted noise... There are photoshop-actions available on the internet that can help in applying grain to an image in a way that creates a much more varied (between the highlights and shadows), natural looking result.', '2005-10-28 06:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820377, 248192, 34114, '<td valign="top">Looks really good in sepia.</td>', 'Looks really good in sepia.', '2005-10-28 06:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820378, 247050, 46510, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, perhaps a little more room on the right would have created a more balanced image.  she looks a lttle squashed against that edge.</td>', 'Nice portrait, perhaps a little more room on the right would have created a more balanced image.  she looks a lttle squashed against that edge.', '2005-10-28 06:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820379, 248394, 46510, '<td valign="top">A digital photo of a contact print! Old school is cool!</td>', 'A digital photo of a contact print! Old school is cool!', '2005-10-28 06:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820424, 248439, 36199, '<td valign="top">Good image, an uncertain but brighter future, a dark past, this picture is full of atmosphere and an untold story.</td>', 'Good image, an uncertain but brighter future, a dark past, this picture is full of atmosphere and an untold story.', '2005-10-28 07:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820425, 246709, 36199, '<td valign="top">Plenty of atmosphere,  looks like there is a story in the image which we can only guess at. Interesting</td>', 'Plenty of atmosphere,  looks like there is a story in the image which we can only guess at. Interesting', '2005-10-28 07:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820427, 245640, 36199, '<td valign="top">A touching scene which has loads of atmosphere, the yellow rose is a nice touch</td>', 'A touching scene which has loads of atmosphere, the yellow rose is a nice touch', '2005-10-28 07:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820429, 245871, 36199, '<td valign="top">Plenty going on here, a good use of grain to add atmosphere and make an arty picture-good</td>', 'Plenty going on here, a good use of grain to add atmosphere and make an arty picture-good', '2005-10-28 07:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820431, 247337, 36199, '<td valign="top">nice shot, the grain makes it more emotive</td>', 'nice shot, the grain makes it more emotive', '2005-10-28 07:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820447, 247656, 40430, '<td valign="top">The image might be better (it is already really good) if the boat were travelling into the image rather than out of it.  Might be because you had no time other than enough to take this one shot.  Keep up the good work.-6-</td>', 'The image might be better (it is already really good) if the boat were travelling into the image rather than out of it.  Might be because you had no time other than enough to take this one shot.  Keep up the good work.-6-', '2005-10-28 08:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820583, 248444, 39664, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty, it looks like a painting!  You should frame this and hang it on the wall!</td>', 'This is so pretty, it looks like a painting!  You should frame this and hang it on the wall!', '2005-10-28 09:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820586, 248482, 39664, '<td valign="top">The composition is off in this image.  I can''t quite put it into words but this feels off balance and leads my eyes everywhere but no where in particular.</td>', 'The composition is off in this image.  I can''t quite put it into words but this feels off balance and leads my eyes everywhere but no where in particular.', '2005-10-28 09:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820588, 247923, 39664, '<td valign="top">Hi Daniel!  Nice eyes and I am always a sucker for a roman nose.  He has that "morning after" sultry look to him!</td>', 'Hi Daniel!  Nice eyes and I am always a sucker for a roman nose.  He has that "morning after" sultry look to him!', '2005-10-28 09:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820590, 247934, 39664, '<td valign="top">I see action blur more than image grain here.</td>', 'I see action blur more than image grain here.', '2005-10-28 09:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820591, 248389, 39664, '<td valign="top">This is awesome.  I really like the grain in every part but the bright flower.  Nicely done!</td>', 'This is awesome.  I really like the grain in every part but the bright flower.  Nicely done!', '2005-10-28 10:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820594, 248418, 39664, '<td valign="top">I love this!  I am so into trees like this!  So much character.....</td>', 'I love this!  I am so into trees like this!  So much character.....', '2005-10-28 10:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820595, 247981, 39664, '<td valign="top">Fierce!</td>', 'Fierce!', '2005-10-28 10:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820596, 248066, 39664, '<td valign="top">Nice work!  Very urban and gritty feel to it.  The graffiti is a plus too!</td>', 'Nice work!  Very urban and gritty feel to it.  The graffiti is a plus too!', '2005-10-28 10:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820597, 248046, 39664, '<td valign="top">Too centered and the lighthouse at this angle appears to be leaning away from you.  The colors make this look very flat.</td>', 'Too centered and the lighthouse at this angle appears to be leaning away from you.  The colors make this look very flat.', '2005-10-28 10:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820598, 248176, 39664, '<td valign="top">This has an Escher-isc effect even with the muted tones.  Nice image!</td>', 'This has an Escher-isc effect even with the muted tones.  Nice image!', '2005-10-28 10:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820600, 248192, 39664, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  I love how you got the water raining down from the center animal''s mouth.</td>', 'Very nice shot!  I love how you got the water raining down from the center animal''s mouth.', '2005-10-28 10:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820603, 246339, 39664, '<td valign="top">Isn''t this a baby....a fawn?  It glows too much for my liking.</td>', 'Isn''t this a baby....a fawn?  It glows too much for my liking.', '2005-10-28 10:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820619, 247845, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific football image.  All of the explosive movement, the violent impact, and even the suggestion of the noise; it''s all there!  The fact that you have managed to reserve your focus only for the ball carrier is a stunning achievement ... I cannot imagine how you did that so convincingly (there must be some post-processing involved, but whatever you did, it''s seamless).  And of course you didn''t overdo the grain - just enough for a ''documentary'' impact.  This photograph gets better the longer I look at it!  One of my all-time favourite sports images.  10</td>', 'This is a terrific football image.  All of the explosive movement, the violent impact, and even the suggestion of the noise; it''s all there!  The fact that you have managed to reserve your focus only for the ball carrier is a stunning achievement ... I cannot imagine how you did that so convincingly (there must be some post-processing involved, but whatever you did, it''s seamless).  And of course you didn''t overdo the grain - just enough for a ''documentary'' impact.  This photograph gets better the longer I look at it!  One of my all-time favourite sports images.  10', '2005-10-28 10:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820630, 248492, 30364, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if you''ve read the brilliant novel "Industry of Souls" by Martin Booth, but this powerful, disturbing image would make a perfect cover photograph.  Such an original take on the concept of ''grain'' too, and it''s certainly no gimmick ... it''s contextually totally credible.  9</td>', 'I don''t know if you''ve read the brilliant novel "Industry of Souls" by Martin Booth, but this powerful, disturbing image would make a perfect cover photograph.  Such an original take on the concept of ''grain'' too, and it''s certainly no gimmick ... it''s contextually totally credible.  9', '2005-10-28 10:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820646, 248054, 30364, '<td valign="top">Perfect title for this simple but elegant portrait of a very impressive subject.  The grain is discrete, and probably not even essential to the impact of the image (she''d look just as strong and dignified no matter what you did anyway).  And the plain, centred composition is absolutely right for this lady; she''s a person, not a model.  8</td>', 'Perfect title for this simple but elegant portrait of a very impressive subject.  The grain is discrete, and probably not even essential to the impact of the image (she''d look just as strong and dignified no matter what you did anyway).  And the plain, centred composition is absolutely right for this lady; she''s a person, not a model.  8', '2005-10-28 10:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820652, 248524, 30364, '<td valign="top">Very appealing photograph of an interesting subject.  It''s the kind of ''real life'' portrait that is so much more memorable and powerful than all that artfully posed crap.  The grain is subtle, but sufficient for your purpose.  Nice work.  8</td>', 'Very appealing photograph of an interesting subject.  It''s the kind of ''real life'' portrait that is so much more memorable and powerful than all that artfully posed crap.  The grain is subtle, but sufficient for your purpose.  Nice work.  8', '2005-10-28 10:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820666, 248116, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very interesting photograph.  I love the idea of the virtually empty and almost entirely reflected scene, and the fact that the man appears to be holding a conversation with himself.  And the strange, grainy tone you''ve used adds to the feeling of dislocation.  7</td>', 'A very interesting photograph.  I love the idea of the virtually empty and almost entirely reflected scene, and the fact that the man appears to be holding a conversation with himself.  And the strange, grainy tone you''ve used adds to the feeling of dislocation.  7', '2005-10-28 10:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820674, 248257, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice!</td>', 'nice!', '2005-10-28 10:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820676, 248389, 16241, '<td valign="top">great!</td>', 'great!', '2005-10-28 10:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820678, 247337, 16241, '<td valign="top">good</td>', 'good', '2005-10-28 10:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820680, 248431, 16241, '<td valign="top">good!</td>', 'good!', '2005-10-28 10:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820696, 247365, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is such a powerful photo.   It really does look like you can see right through those eyes to her soul!!!</td>', 'This is such a powerful photo.   It really does look like you can see right through those eyes to her soul!!!', '2005-10-28 11:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820700, 248405, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful composition.   I love the vintage feel to this. . .and she is such a beautiful model -- so comfortable looking in front of the camera.</td>', 'What a wonderful composition.   I love the vintage feel to this. . .and she is such a beautiful model -- so comfortable looking in front of the camera.', '2005-10-28 11:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820702, 246764, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is awesome.   I think I would have liked a much closer crop, with just the hands in the photo -- but that may be just my personal style.   But I still love the photo.  It''s very strong!</td>', 'This is awesome.   I think I would have liked a much closer crop, with just the hands in the photo -- but that may be just my personal style.   But I still love the photo.  It''s very strong!', '2005-10-28 11:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820707, 248362, 24454, '<td valign="top">How beautiful!!!!   This is one where the grain really does enhance the photo.  It''s the type of wonderful photo that never ages.   You only have such a brief time that you could capture a photo like this because they grow so fast.   You will treasure it forever.   Great job.</td>', 'How beautiful!!!!   This is one where the grain really does enhance the photo.  It''s the type of wonderful photo that never ages.   You only have such a brief time that you could capture a photo like this because they grow so fast.   You will treasure it forever.   Great job.', '2005-10-28 11:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820708, 247337, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very moving portrait and a particularly effective use of grain to complement the desolate, dark mood.  Everything about it is subtle and slightly understated; the man''s expression, the lighting and the processing.  And paradoxically, this understatement adds to the emotional impact of the photograph.  8</td>', 'A very moving portrait and a particularly effective use of grain to complement the desolate, dark mood.  Everything about it is subtle and slightly understated; the man''s expression, the lighting and the processing.  And paradoxically, this understatement adds to the emotional impact of the photograph.  8', '2005-10-28 11:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820709, 248439, 24454, '<td valign="top">Great use of grain here!!  It really does enhance it!    Very strong image!</td>', 'Great use of grain here!!  It really does enhance it!    Very strong image!', '2005-10-28 11:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820712, 247868, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well, I love these hats - I wear similar ones (alas, not Borsalino) myself.  Beautifully composed and lit scene, and effective use of grain to complement the mood evoked by the composition &amp; subject.  7</td>', 'Well, I love these hats - I wear similar ones (alas, not Borsalino) myself.  Beautifully composed and lit scene, and effective use of grain to complement the mood evoked by the composition & subject.  7', '2005-10-28 11:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820714, 248054, 24454, '<td valign="top">Powerful image.   II am particularly drawn to the culture and time this photo represents.  It''s one of my favorites.    I love your use of sepia, and I love the expression on her face.   Great job.    My only suggestion would be to maybe not center her so straight-up-the-middle.   Maybe have her off to one side -- adding the rule of thirds interest to your photo.   But I really love it anyway!</td>', 'Powerful image.   II am particularly drawn to the culture and time this photo represents.  It''s one of my favorites.    I love your use of sepia, and I love the expression on her face.   Great job.    My only suggestion would be to maybe not center her so straight-up-the-middle.   Maybe have her off to one side -- adding the rule of thirds interest to your photo.   But I really love it anyway!', '2005-10-28 11:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820721, 248530, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nearly brilliant.  There''s something not quite right about the positioning of the train.  Maybe.  What is absolutely terrific is the marvellous profusion of converging lines, and the interplay between the lighter and darker tones.  7</td>', 'Nearly brilliant.  There''s something not quite right about the positioning of the train.  Maybe.  What is absolutely terrific is the marvellous profusion of converging lines, and the interplay between the lighter and darker tones.  7', '2005-10-28 11:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820734, 247833, 31403, '<td valign="top">there is so much to look at in this photo I wonder what the subject is - I think it''s the cactus - more contrast would help this, but would still leave me wondering what the subject was - 3</td>', 'there is so much to look at in this photo I wonder what the subject is - I think it''s the cactus - more contrast would help this, but would still leave me wondering what the subject was - 3', '2005-10-28 11:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820735, 248439, 30364, '<td valign="top">Wonderful high-impact composition.   I like everything about it except maybe the grain, which I think might be a little excessive.  However, it certainly does give the scene a touch of ''alternate reality''.  Also love the fact that the man''s hands appear to be in his pockets.  Don''t know why, it just seems delightfully whimsical in the context of this scene.  8</td>', 'Wonderful high-impact composition.   I like everything about it except maybe the grain, which I think might be a little excessive.  However, it certainly does give the scene a touch of ''alternate reality''.  Also love the fact that the man''s hands appear to be in his pockets.  Don''t know why, it just seems delightfully whimsical in the context of this scene.  8', '2005-10-28 11:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820751, 248257, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is very powerful - it certainly does evoke the idea of a fallen captain.  The hint of dust below the eye and lower horn adds to that effect; as if the animal has just now fallen and is still sliding to a halt - absurd of course, given that it''s a long-dead skull, but the feeling is there nonetheless.  The grain is of course entirely appropriate and contributes to the impact.  9</td>', 'This is very powerful - it certainly does evoke the idea of a fallen captain.  The hint of dust below the eye and lower horn adds to that effect; as if the animal has just now fallen and is still sliding to a halt - absurd of course, given that it''s a long-dead skull, but the feeling is there nonetheless.  The grain is of course entirely appropriate and contributes to the impact.  9', '2005-10-28 11:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820752, 247492, 31403, '<td valign="top">cool image, where''s the grain?</td>', 'cool image, where''s the grain?', '2005-10-28 11:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820765, 248175, 31403, '<td valign="top">cropped down to more of the frosted rose would make this a much stronger photo - the pink competes with the rose for my attention.  Very pretty though</td>', 'cropped down to more of the frosted rose would make this a much stronger photo - the pink competes with the rose for my attention.  Very pretty though', '2005-10-28 11:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820772, 245659, 31403, '<td valign="top">stunning color, texture, and light - love the stems alligned, and the one pear being so different in shape - classic composition makes this feel like a painting in a museum.  The fact that I love this so much may have cursed you to not receive the blue ribbon you deserve - 10</td>', 'stunning color, texture, and light - love the stems alligned, and the one pear being so different in shape - classic composition makes this feel like a painting in a museum.  The fact that I love this so much may have cursed you to not receive the blue ribbon you deserve - 10', '2005-10-28 11:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820841, 248377, 46814, '<td valign="top">good observation</td>', 'good observation', '2005-10-28 12:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820925, 247662, 42100, '<td valign="top">Like the unique take on the street rod!  Works for me as an art shot, something more than just a cool car shot!</td>', 'Like the unique take on the street rod!  Works for me as an art shot, something more than just a cool car shot!', '2005-10-28 12:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820930, 245659, 7291, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and color!</td>', 'Beautiful light and color!', '2005-10-28 13:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820931, 248431, 42100, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, very well done.  But I think your skills were upstaged by your model, the expression is pretty amazing!</td>', 'I really like this photo, very well done.  But I think your skills were upstaged by your model, the expression is pretty amazing!', '2005-10-28 13:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820933, 247981, 7291, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Great expression.  The tatoo really finishes the picture off.</td>', 'Nice!  Great expression.  The tatoo really finishes the picture off.', '2005-10-28 13:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820936, 247981, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great use of film grain.  Love everything about this photo, you got it all right.</td>', 'Great use of film grain.  Love everything about this photo, you got it all right.', '2005-10-28 13:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820939, 247365, 7291, '<td valign="top">I don''t see much grain but it''s a great picture non the less.</td>', 'I don''t see much grain but it''s a great picture non the less.', '2005-10-28 13:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820943, 245984, 7291, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get it, and there isn''t much grain, but that''s a cute picture regardless.</td>', 'I don''t really get it, and there isn''t much grain, but that''s a cute picture regardless.', '2005-10-28 13:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820944, 248034, 7291, '<td valign="top">Sheesh.  I feel like crying now.</td>', 'Sheesh.  I feel like crying now.', '2005-10-28 13:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820948, 248527, 7291, '<td valign="top">I like the dramatic lighting.</td>', 'I like the dramatic lighting.', '2005-10-28 13:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820953, 248124, 7291, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  This would actually look very nice withOUT the grain.  I hope you added grain to this one and you have an original without it.</td>', 'Nice picture.  This would actually look very nice withOUT the grain.  I hope you added grain to this one and you have an original without it.', '2005-10-28 13:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820960, 246709, 7291, '<td valign="top">Outstanding!  The grain looks a little "fakey" at 2nd glance but it certainly does it''s job by adding character to this picture.  That was the purpose of this challenge after all.</td>', 'Outstanding!  The grain looks a little "fakey" at 2nd glance but it certainly does it''s job by adding character to this picture.  That was the purpose of this challenge after all.', '2005-10-28 13:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1820962, 247492, 7291, '<td valign="top">Fascinating picture.  If the sunet/rise is in the far background, how did you light the picture from right to left?  Excellent result!</td>', 'Fascinating picture.  If the sunet/rise is in the far background, how did you light the picture from right to left?  Excellent result!', '2005-10-28 13:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821236, 247361, 45173, '<td valign="top">Detail are not as clear as they should be.  Can''t see the eyes of all of the Dalphins.  Picture too dark</td>', 'Detail are not as clear as they should be.  Can''t see the eyes of all of the Dalphins.  Picture too dark', '2005-10-28 15:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821298, 248111, 29658, '<td valign="top">I like the picture but I''m not convinced that the noise is part of the message</td>', 'I like the picture but I''m not convinced that the noise is part of the message', '2005-10-28 15:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821598, 247656, 46679, '<td valign="top">Very well done indeed. I like the way the shapes in the mist and the island balance out the picture.</td>', 'Very well done indeed. I like the way the shapes in the mist and the island balance out the picture.', '2005-10-28 17:54:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1821604, 248447, 46679, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic, the sad, young face. God forgive him, yes, very appropriate.</td>', 'Very dramatic, the sad, young face. God forgive him, yes, very appropriate.', '2005-10-28 17:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821606, 247050, 46679, '<td valign="top">This is very well done.</td>', 'This is very well done.', '2005-10-28 17:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821759, 248345, 30364, '<td valign="top">A brilliant street photograph.  We see far too little of this stimulating genre at DPC, and yours is a terrific example of it.  I am especially impressed by the details ; the spotlit legs of the ''marching'' pedestrians, the perfect positioning in the scene of the primary subject, and the fact that all faces bar his are turned away ... any of these alone would have been pleasing, but to capture all of them together can only be a remarkable mix of skill and good fortune.  Add to that the man''s slightly bewildered expression, his hat, the finger to his brow, and what is presumably a furled collapsible umbrella inexplicably held aloft like a flag, and you have an image that can easily provide half an hour''s entertainment for the thoughtful viewer.   Well, maybe not half an hour; lets just say about fifty times longer than the DPC average. 10</td>', 'A brilliant street photograph.  We see far too little of this stimulating genre at DPC, and yours is a terrific example of it.  I am especially impressed by the details ; the spotlit legs of the ''marching'' pedestrians, the perfect positioning in the scene of the primary subject, and the fact that all faces bar his are turned away ... any of these alone would have been pleasing, but to capture all of them together can only be a remarkable mix of skill and good fortune.  Add to that the man''s slightly bewildered expression, his hat, the finger to his brow, and what is presumably a furled collapsible umbrella inexplicably held aloft like a flag, and you have an image that can easily provide half an hour''s entertainment for the thoughtful viewer.   Well, maybe not half an hour; lets just say about fifty times longer than the DPC average. 10', '2005-10-28 19:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821767, 248356, 30364, '<td valign="top">Presumably this is an elevated boardwalk above an ocean very convincingly turned to fire and brimstone.  It''s a terrific composition, expertly photographed and processed, but it''s the great idea that impresses me the most.  8 ...  Nope, bump to 9.</td>', 'Presumably this is an elevated boardwalk above an ocean very convincingly turned to fire and brimstone.  It''s a terrific composition, expertly photographed and processed, but it''s the great idea that impresses me the most.  8 ...  Nope, bump to 9.', '2005-10-28 19:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821775, 248435, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s like a puzzle ... I feel I want to slide the windows around on the wall to solve the riddle of the blank space.  It''s artistically interesting and it challenges the viewer''s imagination ... and that''s way more than most in this challenge!  Of course, it would work just as well without the grain but I like it anyway.  7.</td>', 'It''s like a puzzle ... I feel I want to slide the windows around on the wall to solve the riddle of the blank space.  It''s artistically interesting and it challenges the viewer''s imagination ... and that''s way more than most in this challenge!  Of course, it would work just as well without the grain but I like it anyway.  7.', '2005-10-28 19:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821789, 248482, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a careful &amp; effective composition, combining shapes, lines and tones beautifully and effortlessly.  Oddly, although I can understand the role of the grain, I actually think it might detract a little, because it ''flattens'' the scene out, and robs it of the sense of depth implicit in the lines ... makes it look a little like a painted theatrical backdrop.  Still a nice image though.  7</td>', 'This is a careful & effective composition, combining shapes, lines and tones beautifully and effortlessly.  Oddly, although I can understand the role of the grain, I actually think it might detract a little, because it ''flattens'' the scene out, and robs it of the sense of depth implicit in the lines ... makes it look a little like a painted theatrical backdrop.  Still a nice image though.  7', '2005-10-28 19:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821805, 247245, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s sackcloth and ashes, of course ... and, in view of the title, in this case it''s for mourning rather than pentinence.  That makes me nervous about commenting freely, because it looks real rather than simulated.  It makes a stark and arresting image.  The lighting is beautiful, the composition is simple yet elegant, and the processing, including the use of grain, is sympathetic to the mood and the subject.   8</td>', 'It''s sackcloth and ashes, of course ... and, in view of the title, in this case it''s for mourning rather than pentinence.  That makes me nervous about commenting freely, because it looks real rather than simulated.  It makes a stark and arresting image.  The lighting is beautiful, the composition is simple yet elegant, and the processing, including the use of grain, is sympathetic to the mood and the subject.   8', '2005-10-28 19:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1821816, 248269, 30364, '<td valign="top">Terrific portrait.  It''s one of those rare images in which the care with which it was constructed, lit, captured and processed is not immediately obvious.  You look at it &amp; are first struck by the appealing little boy and the adult hands, and it just looks like a very nice photograph.  It''s only when you consider why it looks so good that you begin to notice just how much care and skill went into its creation.    8</td>', 'Terrific portrait.  It''s one of those rare images in which the care with which it was constructed, lit, captured and processed is not immediately obvious.  You look at it & are first struck by the appealing little boy and the adult hands, and it just looks like a very nice photograph.  It''s only when you consider why it looks so good that you begin to notice just how much care and skill went into its creation.    8', '2005-10-28 19:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822096, 247933, 1128, '<td valign="top">love the way her overalls are exposed.  is it my monitor, or is the dark part inside her mouth too light?  Her shirt seems a little overexposed, but I love the expression on her face!</td>', 'love the way her overalls are exposed.  is it my monitor, or is the dark part inside her mouth too light?  Her shirt seems a little overexposed, but I love the expression on her face!', '2005-10-28 22:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822104, 248362, 1128, '<td valign="top">Terrific framing, really.  I love the selective focusing and color choice.  The only thing I would have changed is the marks on the adult''s finger-- they''re a little distracting.  But overall, wonderful!</td>', 'Terrific framing, really.  I love the selective focusing and color choice.  The only thing I would have changed is the marks on the adult''s finger-- they''re a little distracting.  But overall, wonderful!', '2005-10-28 23:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822107, 247589, 1128, '<td valign="top">Ah, the Hancock.  I was shooting this yesterday!  Great title.  Nice perspective.</td>', 'Ah, the Hancock.  I was shooting this yesterday!  Great title.  Nice perspective.', '2005-10-28 23:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822110, 246927, 39287, '<td valign="top">This is interesting... I really like it.</td>', 'This is interesting... I really like it.', '2005-10-28 23:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822111, 248474, 1128, '<td valign="top">Ironically, I would have loved this more if it had a little LESS grain.  The noise is a little too distracting, but I love the set up very much.  Lots of movement in this photo.</td>', 'Ironically, I would have loved this more if it had a little LESS grain.  The noise is a little too distracting, but I love the set up very much.  Lots of movement in this photo.', '2005-10-28 23:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822113, 245995, 39287, '<td valign="top">I love this picture!! But I really think her hair should be in a diff position..</td>', 'I love this picture!! But I really think her hair should be in a diff position..', '2005-10-28 23:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822121, 248256, 4226, '<td valign="top">Great sky</td>', 'Great sky', '2005-10-28 23:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822125, 248422, 4226, '<td valign="top">returning for comments. Nice expression, addition of grain enahances subject. bumpiiing up</td>', 'returning for comments. Nice expression, addition of grain enahances subject. bumpiiing up', '2005-10-28 23:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822127, 248080, 4226, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Bumping up</td>', 'Nice composition. Bumping up', '2005-10-28 23:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822129, 245640, 4226, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of selective desaturation, but it works here enhancing the photograph. Nice work.</td>', 'I am not a fan of selective desaturation, but it works here enhancing the photograph. Nice work.', '2005-10-28 23:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822131, 247720, 1128, '<td valign="top">I don''t know exactly why, but I absolutely love this.  Grain is perfect, drops are lovely.  Excellent!</td>', 'I don''t know exactly why, but I absolutely love this.  Grain is perfect, drops are lovely.  Excellent!', '2005-10-28 23:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822172, 248460, 1128, '<td valign="top">This image made me laugh hysterically (especially the title).  But I''m curious-- how does grain connect with this photo?  I know the image is grainy, but the subject matter does not seem to be enhanced by the grain.  I just had to comment, because it''s one of those obscure photos that makes me laugh.  Keep shooting!</td>', 'This image made me laugh hysterically (especially the title).  But I''m curious-- how does grain connect with this photo?  I know the image is grainy, but the subject matter does not seem to be enhanced by the grain.  I just had to comment, because it''s one of those obscure photos that makes me laugh.  Keep shooting!', '2005-10-28 23:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822179, 246339, 1128, '<td valign="top">It''s lucky that you caught this image!  Parts of it seem very overexposed on my monitor.</td>', 'It''s lucky that you caught this image!  Parts of it seem very overexposed on my monitor.', '2005-10-28 23:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822194, 247981, 1128, '<td valign="top">Terrific.  The grain and black and white work really well here, and his expression and tattoo are awesome.  Great job!</td>', 'Terrific.  The grain and black and white work really well here, and his expression and tattoo are awesome.  Great job!', '2005-10-28 23:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822202, 247484, 1128, '<td valign="top">This image seems pretty washed out on my monitor.  Try adjusting the contrast, or if you have photoshop, try adjusting the levels.  I love all those deer!  :)</td>', 'This image seems pretty washed out on my monitor.  Try adjusting the contrast, or if you have photoshop, try adjusting the levels.  I love all those deer!  :)', '2005-10-28 23:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822210, 248531, 1128, '<td valign="top">This focus seems pretty fuzzy to me, but I like the shades of color in the wood.</td>', 'This focus seems pretty fuzzy to me, but I like the shades of color in the wood.', '2005-10-28 23:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822222, 247875, 1128, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo.  However, It leaves me wondering whether or not the grain really enhanced the image.  To me, grain works best in photos that are dark, contrasty or moody, or to provide an "aged" look.  This seems to me like a good image that had grain added to it for a contest, rather than an image that was enhanced by the use of grain.  Keep shooting!  :)</td>', 'This is a nice photo.  However, It leaves me wondering whether or not the grain really enhanced the image.  To me, grain works best in photos that are dark, contrasty or moody, or to provide an "aged" look.  This seems to me like a good image that had grain added to it for a contest, rather than an image that was enhanced by the use of grain.  Keep shooting!  :)', '2005-10-28 23:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
