(1822263, 247720, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract shot. I can see the umbrellas, but my eyes have to work hard at it. Some grain, but compared to other entries, for me, it doesn''t hold my interest as much. Guess I''m not into abstracts - sorry.</td>', 'Interesting abstract shot. I can see the umbrellas, but my eyes have to work hard at it. Some grain, but compared to other entries, for me, it doesn''t hold my interest as much. Guess I''m not into abstracts - sorry.', '2005-10-29 00:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822270, 245970, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, this is a nice enough snapshot of a city street, but compared with other entries the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest. There is grain, but again for me, I find that sepia or black and white photos with grain have greater impact. I wonder how this would look in black and white and a bit of added contrast?</td>', 'For me, this is a nice enough snapshot of a city street, but compared with other entries the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest. There is grain, but again for me, I find that sepia or black and white photos with grain have greater impact. I wonder how this would look in black and white and a bit of added contrast?', '2005-10-29 00:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822272, 245944, 41675, '<td valign="top">My favorite part is the shape of the tree and trunk itself. Had this been a bit crisper, with more contrast and greater grain, I would have scored it higher.</td>', 'My favorite part is the shape of the tree and trunk itself. Had this been a bit crisper, with more contrast and greater grain, I would have scored it higher.', '2005-10-29 00:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822278, 246339, 41675, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what post-processing you used, but for me, this is a soft photo, especially with the glow and luminescent white around the legs - almost the opposite of how I''m looking at the grain challenge. Nice photo and composition, but for me doesn''t meet the challenge criteria as well as other entries.</td>', 'I don''t know what post-processing you used, but for me, this is a soft photo, especially with the glow and luminescent white around the legs - almost the opposite of how I''m looking at the grain challenge. Nice photo and composition, but for me doesn''t meet the challenge criteria as well as other entries.', '2005-10-29 00:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822281, 248033, 41675, '<td valign="top">I read your title...and I''m guessing that the person in the foreground is on the telephone, but it''s difficult to discern. Personally, I''m not a fan of blurred motion shots and therefore I have given you a lower score compared with other entries in this challenge. It''s artsy, I suppose...but just not my cup of tea so to speak. Sorry.</td>', 'I read your title...and I''m guessing that the person in the foreground is on the telephone, but it''s difficult to discern. Personally, I''m not a fan of blurred motion shots and therefore I have given you a lower score compared with other entries in this challenge. It''s artsy, I suppose...but just not my cup of tea so to speak. Sorry.', '2005-10-29 00:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822287, 246813, 41675, '<td valign="top">Not bad, and with a few adjustments I think this could be better. It seems to be tilting to the left and I wonder if rotating the horizon a bit clockwise would help? Also, and this is just me personally, I find that black and white or sepia photos with grain have greater impact than color photos.</td>', 'Not bad, and with a few adjustments I think this could be better. It seems to be tilting to the left and I wonder if rotating the horizon a bit clockwise would help? Also, and this is just me personally, I find that black and white or sepia photos with grain have greater impact than color photos.', '2005-10-29 00:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822291, 248479, 41675, '<td valign="top">My favorite part of your photo is the fish on the far right. My least favorite part is the fish on the left - although it is in the grainiest part of yout photo. It''s an okay photo, but for me, it doesn''t hold my interest or make me say "wow" compared to other entries.</td>', 'My favorite part of your photo is the fish on the far right. My least favorite part is the fish on the left - although it is in the grainiest part of yout photo. It''s an okay photo, but for me, it doesn''t hold my interest or make me say "wow" compared to other entries.', '2005-10-29 00:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822292, 248099, 41675, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot of the sun''s rays through the trees. For me, it doesn''t quite fit into the grain challenge as well as other entries, but again good capture of the light rays.</td>', 'This is a nice shot of the sun''s rays through the trees. For me, it doesn''t quite fit into the grain challenge as well as other entries, but again good capture of the light rays.', '2005-10-29 00:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822297, 247329, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice black-eyed susans. While there is grain in your background, the flowers themselves don''t seem to have any. I wonder how this would look as a black and white with a bit more contrast and grain overall?</td>', 'Nice black-eyed susans. While there is grain in your background, the flowers themselves don''t seem to have any. I wonder how this would look as a black and white with a bit more contrast and grain overall?', '2005-10-29 00:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822299, 245296, 41675, '<td valign="top">One of the better color entries I''ve seen. Your post-processing gives it an almost graphic-like quality. Bumping up after second look.</td>', 'One of the better color entries I''ve seen. Your post-processing gives it an almost graphic-like quality. Bumping up after second look.', '2005-10-29 00:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822301, 246796, 41675, '<td valign="top">While there is grain in the sky and the composition is good with the low horizon, the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest as well as other entries. Too bad there wasn''t any lightening - or something to add a bit more interest.</td>', 'While there is grain in the sky and the composition is good with the low horizon, the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest as well as other entries. Too bad there wasn''t any lightening - or something to add a bit more interest.', '2005-10-29 00:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822305, 247934, 41675, '<td valign="top">The idea isn''t bad, but the blurred faces and harsh lighting remind me of a snapshot in a family album. I think if you had zoomed in a bit more on the birthday girl, added a bit of sharpness yet maintained the grain and changed it over to black and white or sepia, I would have voted it better. Keep shooting though - and I am by no means an expert.  Just trying to make comments and give my personal opinion - hope you don''t take offense.</td>', 'The idea isn''t bad, but the blurred faces and harsh lighting remind me of a snapshot in a family album. I think if you had zoomed in a bit more on the birthday girl, added a bit of sharpness yet maintained the grain and changed it over to black and white or sepia, I would have voted it better. Keep shooting though - and I am by no means an expert.  Just trying to make comments and give my personal opinion - hope you don''t take offense.', '2005-10-29 00:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822306, 246279, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the players on the field - they''re close to being silhouettes. Unfortunately, my eyes keep getting drawn upwards to the bright lights and away from what''s most interesting - the players.</td>', 'I like the players on the field - they''re close to being silhouettes. Unfortunately, my eyes keep getting drawn upwards to the bright lights and away from what''s most interesting - the players.', '2005-10-29 00:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822309, 248528, 41675, '<td valign="top">While you do have grain in your photo, for me, the whites have been overblown with post-processing...although you might have been going for a certain look. I do wonder how this would have looked as a simple black and white with a bit of contrast and the same amount of grain.</td>', 'While you do have grain in your photo, for me, the whites have been overblown with post-processing...although you might have been going for a certain look. I do wonder how this would have looked as a simple black and white with a bit of contrast and the same amount of grain.', '2005-10-29 00:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822313, 246582, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to discern if you''re going for wood grain on this, and I just don''t know. Anyhow, I like the colors and the off-centered door. My mind keeps thinking there should have been a few fish hanging off a hook on the left side or some other type of outdoor object(s).</td>', 'I''m trying to discern if you''re going for wood grain on this, and I just don''t know. Anyhow, I like the colors and the off-centered door. My mind keeps thinking there should have been a few fish hanging off a hook on the left side or some other type of outdoor object(s).', '2005-10-29 00:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822319, 248428, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me personally, I''m discovering that image grain has a greater effect with photos being in black and white or sepia. You do have image grain, and I like the sky colors, but again for me, other entries in this challenge hold my interest more.</td>', 'For me personally, I''m discovering that image grain has a greater effect with photos being in black and white or sepia. You do have image grain, and I like the sky colors, but again for me, other entries in this challenge hold my interest more.', '2005-10-29 00:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822322, 247845, 41675, '<td valign="top">You captured a good sense of motion - more so than image grain - in my not so experienced opinion. The whites seem really bright and I find it keeps pulling my eyes to #32 and thereby ignoring the rest of your image.</td>', 'You captured a good sense of motion - more so than image grain - in my not so experienced opinion. The whites seem really bright and I find it keeps pulling my eyes to #32 and thereby ignoring the rest of your image.', '2005-10-29 00:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822328, 248046, 41675, '<td valign="top">An interesting structure. I wonder how this would look as a completely sepia toned image? Also, it seems to tilt slightly to the left. If rotated a bit clockwise to straigthen the horizon, and changing it to sepia - it would give a greater old world kind of feeling, which I think it has the potential to do.</td>', 'An interesting structure. I wonder how this would look as a completely sepia toned image? Also, it seems to tilt slightly to the left. If rotated a bit clockwise to straigthen the horizon, and changing it to sepia - it would give a greater old world kind of feeling, which I think it has the potential to do.', '2005-10-29 00:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822332, 248447, 41675, '<td valign="top">My absolute favorite entry in this challenge. Ofcourse I''m also a Civil War buff - so I''m sure that''s part of it. I like the young lad''s eyes, and the tight composition. Good luck in the challenge - hope you get a ribbon with this one. 10</td>', 'My absolute favorite entry in this challenge. Ofcourse I''m also a Civil War buff - so I''m sure that''s part of it. I like the young lad''s eyes, and the tight composition. Good luck in the challenge - hope you get a ribbon with this one. 10', '2005-10-29 00:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822335, 247981, 41675, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a mesmerizing look on this young boy''s face. One of those photo-journalist type shots that tells a story. Congratulations and good luck in the challenge. 10</td>', 'You''ve captured a mesmerizing look on this young boy''s face. One of those photo-journalist type shots that tells a story. Congratulations and good luck in the challenge. 10', '2005-10-29 00:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822337, 248130, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the top half of your photo. For me, I wonder how this would have looked if you cropped out more of the foreground?</td>', 'I like the top half of your photo. For me, I wonder how this would have looked if you cropped out more of the foreground?', '2005-10-29 00:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822342, 247346, 41675, '<td valign="top">Bumping up after second look. Nice, simple composition and as I interpret the challenge you do have image grain. Had there been a bit more overall contrast, I would have scored it higher.</td>', 'Bumping up after second look. Nice, simple composition and as I interpret the challenge you do have image grain. Had there been a bit more overall contrast, I would have scored it higher.', '2005-10-29 00:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822345, 248384, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your photo gives me a nice, warm old time feel - makes me think of my grandfather. Thanks for bringing back a fond memory. Good lighting, composition and the sepia is perfect. Good luck in the challenge. 10</td>', 'Your photo gives me a nice, warm old time feel - makes me think of my grandfather. Thanks for bringing back a fond memory. Good lighting, composition and the sepia is perfect. Good luck in the challenge. 10', '2005-10-29 00:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822349, 247053, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your title mis-lead me a bit. Her black leather jacket, black pants and high heeled shoes don''t make me think of a redneck, but that''s just me. I wonder how this would look with the brick wall on the right completely cropped out and maybe changed into a black and white instead?</td>', 'Your title mis-lead me a bit. Her black leather jacket, black pants and high heeled shoes don''t make me think of a redneck, but that''s just me. I wonder how this would look with the brick wall on the right completely cropped out and maybe changed into a black and white instead?', '2005-10-29 00:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822353, 248244, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting place - your treatment gives it a spooky feel. Some of the lighter areas seem almost a bit too processed, but it looks like a very old photo - good grain image. 8</td>', 'Interesting place - your treatment gives it a spooky feel. Some of the lighter areas seem almost a bit too processed, but it looks like a very old photo - good grain image. 8', '2005-10-29 00:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822356, 246759, 41675, '<td valign="top">:-) I like how you combined grain and image grain...covered all the basis from when the challenge was first announed - clever. 8</td>', ':-) I like how you combined grain and image grain...covered all the basis from when the challenge was first announed - clever. 8', '2005-10-29 00:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822363, 247491, 41675, '<td valign="top">Had there been a bit more contrast I would have scored this higher. As is, it seems kind of flat to me...or maybe if there was more sky or more foreground so that the mill itself wasn''t in the "dead" center of the horizon.</td>', 'Had there been a bit more contrast I would have scored this higher. As is, it seems kind of flat to me...or maybe if there was more sky or more foreground so that the mill itself wasn''t in the "dead" center of the horizon.', '2005-10-29 00:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822367, 248062, 41675, '<td valign="top">Looks like a very nice church. I like your composition, although the branch in the upper left just kind of seems to be floating there. I wonder how it would look without the branch or even more of it to help actually frame that corner more?</td>', 'Looks like a very nice church. I like your composition, although the branch in the upper left just kind of seems to be floating there. I wonder how it would look without the branch or even more of it to help actually frame that corner more?', '2005-10-29 00:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1822478, 246709, 46177, '<td valign="top">Such an amazing picture so much feeling captured here, I love the way the grain suits this it adds emotion to the entire image. Definately a favorite.</td>', 'Such an amazing picture so much feeling captured here, I love the way the grain suits this it adds emotion to the entire image. Definately a favorite.', '2005-10-29 01:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
