(1823733, 247506, 10268, '<td valign="top">Clever!  Awesome shot. 8.</td>', 'Clever!  Awesome shot. 8.', '2005-10-29 22:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1823823, 247045, 33672, '<td valign="top">Dof make an interesting composition, Nice seasonal touch.</td>', 'Dof make an interesting composition, Nice seasonal touch.', '2005-10-29 22:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1823825, 248462, 33672, '<td valign="top">Lighting is fantastic, very emotive.</td>', 'Lighting is fantastic, very emotive.', '2005-10-29 22:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1823828, 248239, 33672, '<td valign="top">Too much of a photo of artwork for me.</td>', 'Too much of a photo of artwork for me.', '2005-10-29 22:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1823832, 247979, 33672, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W may have seved better as the noise doesn''t add to the colors.  (only my opinion)</td>', 'B&W may have seved better as the noise doesn''t add to the colors.  (only my opinion)', '2005-10-29 22:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1823835, 248183, 33672, '<td valign="top">Looks like an old western photo.  Nice job.</td>', 'Looks like an old western photo.  Nice job.', '2005-10-29 22:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1823964, 248485, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice.  Good subtle colors.  Good use of grain/noise(?) for the Challenge.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a tighter crop at the top, or a slightly sharper (ground up-ish) angle, may have made this a better shot in my opinion.  I imagine it would look good b/w or sepia too, but I like that you left it like this.  Perhaps even more grain too, not sure.</td>', '8 - Nice.  Good subtle colors.  Good use of grain/noise(?) for the Challenge.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a tighter crop at the top, or a slightly sharper (ground up-ish) angle, may have made this a better shot in my opinion.  I imagine it would look good b/w or sepia too, but I like that you left it like this.  Perhaps even more grain too, not sure.', '2005-10-30 00:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1823970, 248382, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good shot, excellent colors and good use of ''selective effects''(?) for this Challenge.  I am still learning what is ''allowed'' in advanced editing (excuse me), but will vote this as if ''legal'' (won''t be me making any dq requests).  The more I look at this, I realize that it is the vivid colors and ''popness'' of the flowers that appeals so much, the ''effect'' on the bee is good, but doesn''t ''dominate'' here.  Criticism; ''somehow'' would like to have seen a greater ''use'' of the grain/noise to create an ''illusion'' or ''surreal'' effect.  Had this at 8 at first glance, but down to 7 based on the above, reinforced by the fact that <i>"image grain or "noise" is an integral part of the message of your photo"</i>, has not been fully achieved in this shot, in my opinion.  Creative idea, I just think it has/had more potential, primarily with the bee ''dominating'' rather than the flowers/colors. 3rd view: taking down to 6 based primarily on lack of grain and seemingly pure ''pp'' noise effects, which again, may have had more potential.  Tough call on this shot re the Challenge, in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Good shot, excellent colors and good use of ''selective effects''(?) for this Challenge.  I am still learning what is ''allowed'' in advanced editing (excuse me), but will vote this as if ''legal'' (won''t be me making any dq requests).  The more I look at this, I realize that it is the vivid colors and ''popness'' of the flowers that appeals so much, the ''effect'' on the bee is good, but doesn''t ''dominate'' here.  Criticism; ''somehow'' would like to have seen a greater ''use'' of the grain/noise to create an ''illusion'' or ''surreal'' effect.  Had this at 8 at first glance, but down to 7 based on the above, reinforced by the fact that "image grain or "noise" is an integral part of the message of your photo", has not been fully achieved in this shot, in my opinion.  Creative idea, I just think it has/had more potential, primarily with the bee ''dominating'' rather than the flowers/colors. 3rd view: taking down to 6 based primarily on lack of grain and seemingly pure ''pp'' noise effects, which again, may have had more potential.  Tough call on this shot re the Challenge, in my opinion.', '2005-10-30 00:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
