(1824471, 247833, 14735, '<td valign="top">The light is very flat here and the sky are is too plain. Might have cropped out the brick wall on the right.</td>', 'The light is very flat here and the sky are is too plain. Might have cropped out the brick wall on the right.', '2005-10-30 08:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824474, 245944, 14735, '<td valign="top">There is too much detail loss in this photo. Your foreground object which is a large part of the photo is completely black. Subject matter not very interesting.</td>', 'There is too much detail loss in this photo. Your foreground object which is a large part of the photo is completely black. Subject matter not very interesting.', '2005-10-30 08:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824577, 247345, 23053, '<td valign="top">Wow, you must be really tiny or live around some HUGE oak trees.  Anyway, I like the idea and the tonal quality of your shot.  I think it may be a bit longer before you get your ribbon, but all in all, it is a memorable shot, and that is really more important anyway.</td>', 'Wow, you must be really tiny or live around some HUGE oak trees.  Anyway, I like the idea and the tonal quality of your shot.  I think it may be a bit longer before you get your ribbon, but all in all, it is a memorable shot, and that is really more important anyway.', '2005-10-30 10:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824581, 247649, 23053, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...iffy title.  The high contrast and grittiness are very complementary here to your idea, and I think it is an effective shot.  Very painterly...definately more artistic than the shot straight from the camera, I''m sure.</td>', 'Nice shot...iffy title.  The high contrast and grittiness are very complementary here to your idea, and I think it is an effective shot.  Very painterly...definately more artistic than the shot straight from the camera, I''m sure.', '2005-10-30 10:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824583, 247345, 41845, '<td valign="top">I know the feeling LOL</td>', 'I know the feeling LOL', '2005-10-30 11:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824584, 246709, 23053, '<td valign="top">If this doesn''t win, I''m sure something else will.  Anyway...this is a good shot.  The graininess isn''t overpowering but evident enough to be effective.  Overall the shot is dark but this doesn''t result in a detrimental loss of detail.  The mood that I''m sure you were working to achieve is achieved admirably.  Well done...something tells me we will all be seeing this shot for the next week or so.</td>', 'If this doesn''t win, I''m sure something else will.  Anyway...this is a good shot.  The graininess isn''t overpowering but evident enough to be effective.  Overall the shot is dark but this doesn''t result in a detrimental loss of detail.  The mood that I''m sure you were working to achieve is achieved admirably.  Well done...something tells me we will all be seeing this shot for the next week or so.', '2005-10-30 11:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824588, 248498, 23053, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  I like how you can see the grain here without it being distracting.  It adds to the feel and makes this seem more like a painting than a photo.</td>', 'Very cool.  I like how you can see the grain here without it being distracting.  It adds to the feel and makes this seem more like a painting than a photo.', '2005-10-30 11:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824596, 248115, 23053, '<td valign="top">I think this shot has more grain than any other I''ve seen in the challenge so far.  For that, congratulations.  It is a push beyond the norm, and that doesn''t mean that the shot doesn''t work.  I think that the noise here is a bit strong considering the subject, but that doesn''t mean that this amount of noise would be bad given another subject.  Since the noise makes this scene more harsh, it is in contrast to the soft colors and lines of the sunset.  Maybe that is a good contrast...I can''t say for sure.  This does provide a very painted feel to the shot, and the loss of detail is fine for that.  While I don''t expect this shot to do well in the realm of this challenge, that does not mean that it is a bad shot or a bad style.  It is just different.  And, in so doing, it has held my attention, and I''m sure that of a few others, for a good while - which is more than 99% of the other photos in the challenge can say.</td>', 'I think this shot has more grain than any other I''ve seen in the challenge so far.  For that, congratulations.  It is a push beyond the norm, and that doesn''t mean that the shot doesn''t work.  I think that the noise here is a bit strong considering the subject, but that doesn''t mean that this amount of noise would be bad given another subject.  Since the noise makes this scene more harsh, it is in contrast to the soft colors and lines of the sunset.  Maybe that is a good contrast...I can''t say for sure.  This does provide a very painted feel to the shot, and the loss of detail is fine for that.  While I don''t expect this shot to do well in the realm of this challenge, that does not mean that it is a bad shot or a bad style.  It is just different.  And, in so doing, it has held my attention, and I''m sure that of a few others, for a good while - which is more than 99% of the other photos in the challenge can say.', '2005-10-30 11:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824598, 247991, 3032, '<td valign="top">Last time I saw a photograph of this (ID=127647) it was not about hurricanes at all but about the 2nd worldwar.<br/>The color is a bit flat and lacking contrast, the grain is more about color noise and not about pattern filmlike grain.<br/></td>', 'Last time I saw a photograph of this (ID=127647) it was not about hurricanes at all but about the 2nd worldwar.The color is a bit flat and lacking contrast, the grain is more about color noise and not about pattern filmlike grain.', '2005-10-30 11:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824599, 248388, 23053, '<td valign="top">The noise is nice in this shot, and the muted colors seem to fit your mood.  My only complaint is that the noise and color have caused a reduction in the detail of the tree branches, which seems detrimental to the subject.</td>', 'The noise is nice in this shot, and the muted colors seem to fit your mood.  My only complaint is that the noise and color have caused a reduction in the detail of the tree branches, which seems detrimental to the subject.', '2005-10-30 11:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824600, 248441, 41845, '<td valign="top">I hope you don''t get masacred by all the purists on this site love the fx you applied looks like something straight out of one of my books of works by the great masters.  Nicely done. 9</td>', 'I hope you don''t get masacred by all the purists on this site love the fx you applied looks like something straight out of one of my books of works by the great masters.  Nicely done. 9', '2005-10-30 11:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824601, 248160, 41845, '<td valign="top">this is absolutely lovely nice color balance, framing and lighting. 9</td>', 'this is absolutely lovely nice color balance, framing and lighting. 9', '2005-10-30 11:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824602, 247933, 23053, '<td valign="top">Great tones and contrast here.  Nice headband, too.</td>', 'Great tones and contrast here.  Nice headband, too.', '2005-10-30 11:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824605, 248411, 23053, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot for a grain challenge.  I just finished commenting on another shot in the challenge that I felt suffered from a loss of detail due to the noise, and the subject was similar to yours in that it was plantlife that had fine lines.  In your photo, which honestly has finer lines, the detail does not seem harmed, and the softness added by the noise actually helps the shot along.  If this shot had been very sharp, I think some of the effect would have been lost.   Good job.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot for a grain challenge.  I just finished commenting on another shot in the challenge that I felt suffered from a loss of detail due to the noise, and the subject was similar to yours in that it was plantlife that had fine lines.  In your photo, which honestly has finer lines, the detail does not seem harmed, and the softness added by the noise actually helps the shot along.  If this shot had been very sharp, I think some of the effect would have been lost.   Good job.', '2005-10-30 11:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824611, 248224, 23053, '<td valign="top">The noise here has the look of an effects filter in photoshop, like frosted glass, or a texture layer.  It is an effective look, all the same.</td>', 'The noise here has the look of an effects filter in photoshop, like frosted glass, or a texture layer.  It is an effective look, all the same.', '2005-10-30 11:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824627, 245995, 23053, '<td valign="top">Oh great, now I''m gonna have that Twisted Sister song stuck in my head for the next week...ehh...it''s a decent song, I suppose.<br/> <br/>You''ve developed quite a style and are certainly recognizable without it.  This is a striking image that while probably not a ribboner, is definately memorable.  All the same, I hope that you do well and I will help you along by giving you a decent vote.  I like how the light is reflecting off of your pupils...the inversion there adds to the total effect of your image.</td>', 'Oh great, now I''m gonna have that Twisted Sister song stuck in my head for the next week...ehh...it''s a decent song, I suppose. You''ve developed quite a style and are certainly recognizable without it.  This is a striking image that while probably not a ribboner, is definately memorable.  All the same, I hope that you do well and I will help you along by giving you a decent vote.  I like how the light is reflecting off of your pupils...the inversion there adds to the total effect of your image.', '2005-10-30 11:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824658, 245984, 35444, '<td valign="top">What a great picture!  I love the ball int he background and the expression on the dog''s face.  "wanna go out?"</td>', 'What a great picture!  I love the ball int he background and the expression on the dog''s face.  "wanna go out?"', '2005-10-30 11:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824687, 248468, 32221, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, the grain workes very well!</td>', 'I like this a lot, the grain workes very well!', '2005-10-30 12:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824694, 248244, 16488, '<td valign="top">Wonderful feel to this image! It reminds me of those turn-of-the-century souvenir cards. I could just as easily be the ancient wall in Istanbul. Beautiful rendering of the tones. Composition just sucks me in! Good luck! (One of my top picks for the challenge.)</td>', 'Wonderful feel to this image! It reminds me of those turn-of-the-century souvenir cards. I could just as easily be the ancient wall in Istanbul. Beautiful rendering of the tones. Composition just sucks me in! Good luck! (One of my top picks for the challenge.)', '2005-10-30 12:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824695, 246488, 32221, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but, I''m not sure that the addition of grain to this sort of shot improves it</td>', 'Nice capture, but, I''m not sure that the addition of grain to this sort of shot improves it', '2005-10-30 12:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824697, 246709, 16488, '<td valign="top">Gritty drama! The extreme persepective just adds so much to the story of this image! Love the pose, the attitude, the grain.  Only drawback for me is the darkening on the edges of the house and horizon--just a tad too much toward the grunge side. Nonetheless, one of my top pics for the challenge. Good luck!</td>', 'Gritty drama! The extreme persepective just adds so much to the story of this image! Love the pose, the attitude, the grain.  Only drawback for me is the darkening on the edges of the house and horizon--just a tad too much toward the grunge side. Nonetheless, one of my top pics for the challenge. Good luck!', '2005-10-30 12:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824699, 247656, 32221, '<td valign="top">very nice, the grain helps with the mood</td>', 'very nice, the grain helps with the mood', '2005-10-30 12:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824704, 247981, 16488, '<td valign="top">What a toughy! Love this image! The expression on this boy''s face is perfect! All the elements that make this a true portrait are there from the blurred background to the tatooed musular arm with the rolled up sleeve! Only quibble, I''d like to see a  little more detail in that near shirt sleeve. One of my top pics for the challenge!</td>', 'What a toughy! Love this image! The expression on this boy''s face is perfect! All the elements that make this a true portrait are there from the blurred background to the tatooed musular arm with the rolled up sleeve! Only quibble, I''d like to see a  little more detail in that near shirt sleeve. One of my top pics for the challenge!', '2005-10-30 12:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824705, 248375, 32221, '<td valign="top">I quite like this! It would be nice to see without the grain!</td>', 'I quite like this! It would be nice to see without the grain!', '2005-10-30 12:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824709, 248531, 43400, '<td valign="top">Cool rustic image. I like the character and coloring, but wish it was a bit focused/sharper while maintaining the noise--This has great potential.-8</td>', 'Cool rustic image. I like the character and coloring, but wish it was a bit focused/sharper while maintaining the noise--This has great potential.-8', '2005-10-30 12:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
