(1824753, 248439, 16488, '<td valign="top">Moody! Nice! This is one image that just wouldn''t have the same impact without the grain.</td>', 'Moody! Nice! This is one image that just wouldn''t have the same impact without the grain.', '2005-10-30 13:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824762, 248393, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting alley. I like the wood dors and the texture in the buildings. The composition leads the eye to the end of the alley which, unfortunately, is a disappointing finish. Wonder what it would have been like if you''d taken the picture from a few feet to the left allowing the alley to dissolve into black...?</td>', 'Interesting alley. I like the wood dors and the texture in the buildings. The composition leads the eye to the end of the alley which, unfortunately, is a disappointing finish. Wonder what it would have been like if you''d taken the picture from a few feet to the left allowing the alley to dissolve into black...?', '2005-10-30 13:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824765, 245871, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice abstraction! I like the tension of the tow main elements in this image, the graffitied metal wall and the scraggly weeds. The grain helps lend a painterly quality--almost pointilism. There''s a lot to interest the eye here.</td>', 'Nice abstraction! I like the tension of the tow main elements in this image, the graffitied metal wall and the scraggly weeds. The grain helps lend a painterly quality--almost pointilism. There''s a lot to interest the eye here.', '2005-10-30 13:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824767, 248447, 16488, '<td valign="top">Beautifully rendered portrait! The lighting could not have been better! I like the feel of this image a lot!<br/> <br/>Edit: I left the "not" out and it didn''t say what I meant...all fixed.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-31 00:35:56.</i></td>', 'Beautifully rendered portrait! The lighting could not have been better! I like the feel of this image a lot! Edit: I left the "not" out and it didn''t say what I meant...all fixed.', '2005-10-30 13:12:02.000000', '2005-10-31 00:35:56.000000', 1),
(1824838, 248468, 16488, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective composition. The coarse power of the water on the sand and its effects on the wood begin to tell a story of the interaction of elements of nature. Nicely seen.</td>', 'Simple and effective composition. The coarse power of the water on the sand and its effects on the wood begin to tell a story of the interaction of elements of nature. Nicely seen.', '2005-10-30 13:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824839, 248499, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the sultry expression on the young woman''s face. The sharp highlights on the hair (or is it on the feathers or fur?) are somewhat distracting....perhaps with more detail in that part of the photo it wouldn''t be such a mystery.</td>', 'I like the composition and the sultry expression on the young woman''s face. The sharp highlights on the hair (or is it on the feathers or fur?) are somewhat distracting....perhaps with more detail in that part of the photo it wouldn''t be such a mystery.', '2005-10-30 13:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824840, 248254, 16488, '<td valign="top">Sweet expression. I like the dreamy quality of this image. The coarseness of the grain appears to be right for this image, but the flecks of color in the noise/grain detract from the dream. Perhaps applying the grain monochomatically or dropping the saturation on the reds would answer that? The pose and composition are wonderful however.</td>', 'Sweet expression. I like the dreamy quality of this image. The coarseness of the grain appears to be right for this image, but the flecks of color in the noise/grain detract from the dream. Perhaps applying the grain monochomatically or dropping the saturation on the reds would answer that? The pose and composition are wonderful however.', '2005-10-30 13:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824842, 246796, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Can''t say I get your title, though. I feel the silhouette would be stronger if it were perfectly black--perhaps one example of where applying grain to the entire image weakened a part of it.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Can''t say I get your title, though. I feel the silhouette would be stronger if it were perfectly black--perhaps one example of where applying grain to the entire image weakened a part of it.', '2005-10-30 13:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824847, 248183, 16488, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective composition. I like that you''ve maintained the range of tones in this image...they could have been so easily lost to the grain. Nice, timeless feel with the light duotone application. Something about the horse''s pose and direct stare are just so appealing.</td>', 'Simple and effective composition. I like that you''ve maintained the range of tones in this image...they could have been so easily lost to the grain. Nice, timeless feel with the light duotone application. Something about the horse''s pose and direct stare are just so appealing.', '2005-10-30 13:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1824852, 247473, 44287, '<td valign="top">This is really well done! Beautiful!</td>', 'This is really well done! Beautiful!', '2005-10-30 14:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
