(1825096, 248499, 19936, '<td valign="top">Love this look.  I think the grain adds to the mystique.  Good job.</td>', 'Love this look.  I think the grain adds to the mystique.  Good job.', '2005-10-30 17:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825100, 247492, 19936, '<td valign="top">Another greative shot.  Very surreal.</td>', 'Another greative shot.  Very surreal.', '2005-10-30 17:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825101, 248244, 19936, '<td valign="top">Almost like an old old postcard.  I like it.</td>', 'Almost like an old old postcard.  I like it.', '2005-10-30 17:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825105, 248441, 19936, '<td valign="top">On second look I like this one very much.  Has a very old feel to it.  Kind of like and old painting.  Bumping up.</td>', 'On second look I like this one very much.  Has a very old feel to it.  Kind of like and old painting.  Bumping up.', '2005-10-30 17:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825109, 247819, 19936, '<td valign="top">Another old postcard look.  Nice job.</td>', 'Another old postcard look.  Nice job.', '2005-10-30 17:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825110, 247704, 19936, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Points for creativity.</td>', 'LOL!  Points for creativity.', '2005-10-30 17:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825122, 245995, 19936, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this photo trying to figure out if I like it or not.  So it gets points for at least stirring my interest.  Still not sure that it works for me though it is a good shot.  Still it is in my top ten percent.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this photo trying to figure out if I like it or not.  So it gets points for at least stirring my interest.  Still not sure that it works for me though it is a good shot.  Still it is in my top ten percent.', '2005-10-30 17:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825126, 247981, 19936, '<td valign="top">Whao!  He looks like a rebel but I''m sure he is just a little angel.  Great capture.</td>', 'Whao!  He looks like a rebel but I''m sure he is just a little angel.  Great capture.', '2005-10-30 17:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825129, 245939, 19936, '<td valign="top">Very topical for the season.  Spooky and the grain certainly fits.</td>', 'Very topical for the season.  Spooky and the grain certainly fits.', '2005-10-30 17:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825134, 246933, 19936, '<td valign="top">Gotta say I like the message but the shot does not jump out at me.  Still, nice processsing.</td>', 'Gotta say I like the message but the shot does not jump out at me.  Still, nice processsing.', '2005-10-30 17:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825138, 248527, 19936, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic shot.  Light grain is the right choice as heavy grain would have ruined it.  I may have cropped so he was against the side of the frame but still very nice.  Bumping this one up.</td>', 'Very dramatic shot.  Light grain is the right choice as heavy grain would have ruined it.  I may have cropped so he was against the side of the frame but still very nice.  Bumping this one up.', '2005-10-30 17:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825142, 248080, 19936, '<td valign="top">Nice job of processing here.  Grain works well and keeping the eyes in sharp focus adds drama.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice job of processing here.  Grain works well and keeping the eyes in sharp focus adds drama.  Good job.', '2005-10-30 17:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825144, 248356, 19936, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Great scene and processed well to get this mood.</td>', 'Wow.  Great scene and processed well to get this mood.', '2005-10-30 18:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825154, 248063, 19936, '<td valign="top">Not sure the grain matches this shot.  At least for me the expression here brings more light to mind than grain and dark. Still a good effort.</td>', 'Not sure the grain matches this shot.  At least for me the expression here brings more light to mind than grain and dark. Still a good effort.', '2005-10-30 18:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825156, 246759, 19936, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, covering all the bases.  Not sure the noise adds to the grain though.</td>', 'Ahhh, covering all the bases.  Not sure the noise adds to the grain though.', '2005-10-30 18:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825157, 248492, 19936, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool effect. Be interested to see how you obtained it.</td>', 'Pretty cool effect. Be interested to see how you obtained it.', '2005-10-30 18:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825160, 248217, 19936, '<td valign="top">I see the grain but where is the garin?  Seriously though, at least to me this type image would work better with a corner to corner sharpness.</td>', 'I see the grain but where is the garin?  Seriously though, at least to me this type image would work better with a corner to corner sharpness.', '2005-10-30 18:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825167, 246901, 19936, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  But ..... wrong challenge in my book.  The action, framing and sharpness here is wonderful.  Would have done well in a sports, action or water type challenge.</td>', 'Great shot!  But ..... wrong challenge in my book.  The action, framing and sharpness here is wonderful.  Would have done well in a sports, action or water type challenge.', '2005-10-30 18:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825178, 248034, 2158, '<td valign="top">The expression in this photo is amazing.</td>', 'The expression in this photo is amazing.', '2005-10-30 18:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825266, 246709, 18339, '<td valign="top">Hey, that looks like Joeys Dad!  Gorgeous &amp; Moody - 10</td>', 'Hey, that looks like Joeys Dad!  Gorgeous & Moody - 10', '2005-10-30 19:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825273, 248467, 45635, '<td valign="top">nice feel to it</td>', 'nice feel to it', '2005-10-30 19:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825276, 248265, 45635, '<td valign="top">I like this one alot... a little too bright but still very nice</td>', 'I like this one alot... a little too bright but still very nice', '2005-10-30 19:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825303, 248417, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and the colors and lighting are good too. For me though, I do wonder if Neat Image was used. It seems to have a softer focus whereas in this challenge I''m scoring based on image grain. While yes, there is some grain in your shot, (again for me) the soft glow takes away from that.</td>', 'I like the angle and the colors and lighting are good too. For me though, I do wonder if Neat Image was used. It seems to have a softer focus whereas in this challenge I''m scoring based on image grain. While yes, there is some grain in your shot, (again for me) the soft glow takes away from that.', '2005-10-30 19:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825304, 248008, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white of a pelican, but compared with other entries and lack of grain I have given it a lower score.</td>', 'Nice black and white of a pelican, but compared with other entries and lack of grain I have given it a lower score.', '2005-10-30 19:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825305, 247147, 41675, '<td valign="top">Taking a second look, I''m bumping it up a point. I wish it was a bit lighter/brighter overall (seems a bit dark for me), but your color choice gives it an older feel.</td>', 'Taking a second look, I''m bumping it up a point. I wish it was a bit lighter/brighter overall (seems a bit dark for me), but your color choice gives it an older feel.', '2005-10-30 19:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825306, 248411, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. I''ve been looking at it for a moment and trying to decide if Neat Image was used - and can''t decide. Bumping up one point after second look.</td>', 'Interesting photo. I''ve been looking at it for a moment and trying to decide if Neat Image was used - and can''t decide. Bumping up one point after second look.', '2005-10-30 19:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825308, 248063, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I wonder if this would be stronger as a black and white photo. Also, image grain kind of gives photos a gritty, moody kind of look whereas your subject is smiling.</td>', 'For me, I wonder if this would be stronger as a black and white photo. Also, image grain kind of gives photos a gritty, moody kind of look whereas your subject is smiling.', '2005-10-30 19:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825309, 248242, 41675, '<td valign="top">What a sweet face. For me, I think I would have liked this pulled back just a bit and maybe a bit more focus or clarity around those big eyes.</td>', 'What a sweet face. For me, I think I would have liked this pulled back just a bit and maybe a bit more focus or clarity around those big eyes.', '2005-10-30 19:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825315, 248217, 41675, '<td valign="top">While a nice enough photo of actual wheat(?) grain, the challenge rules were changed to focus on image grain/noise.</td>', 'While a nice enough photo of actual wheat(?) grain, the challenge rules were changed to focus on image grain/noise.', '2005-10-30 19:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825333, 247052, 35545, '<td valign="top">I just don''t get what''s going on here.</td>', 'I just don''t get what''s going on here.', '2005-10-30 19:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825339, 248115, 35545, '<td valign="top">I think I get what you were trying to do, but IMHO you went overboard with the grain.</td>', 'I think I get what you were trying to do, but IMHO you went overboard with the grain.', '2005-10-30 20:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825342, 245847, 35545, '<td valign="top">Not a good choice for an angle shot.  It looks as if the bowl is going to fall off.</td>', 'Not a good choice for an angle shot.  It looks as if the bowl is going to fall off.', '2005-10-30 20:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825346, 247494, 3214, '<td valign="top">Guy sure looks like a young Ray Liotta.</td>', 'Guy sure looks like a young Ray Liotta.', '2005-10-30 20:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825347, 247520, 35545, '<td valign="top">A nice shot with an etherial look at the top, but I think you went overboard with the burning or darkening at the lower right.  Also, it looks as if the building is tilting to the right.  A little counterclockwise tweak would help.</td>', 'A nice shot with an etherial look at the top, but I think you went overboard with the burning or darkening at the lower right.  Also, it looks as if the building is tilting to the right.  A little counterclockwise tweak would help.', '2005-10-30 20:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825348, 248269, 3214, '<td valign="top">Dang, this is good.  Great mood and subtle grain.</td>', 'Dang, this is good.  Great mood and subtle grain.', '2005-10-30 20:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825350, 248115, 18080, '<td valign="top">TOO MUCH<br/>good luck though</td>', 'TOO MUCHgood luck though', '2005-10-30 20:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825351, 248412, 35545, '<td valign="top">IMHO you went overboard with the grain/noise and got colored speckles which distract from a nice shot of autumn leaves and running water.  You also need an apostrophe in "Nature''s".  I didn''t mark down for the grammar. 8)</td>', 'IMHO you went overboard with the grain/noise and got colored speckles which distract from a nice shot of autumn leaves and running water.  You also need an apostrophe in "Nature''s".  I didn''t mark down for the grammar. 8)', '2005-10-30 20:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825355, 246826, 35545, '<td valign="top">I think you have a good idea here, but those colored speckles in the top of the lantern really distract me -- they remind me of the sprinkles they put on donuts, and I doubt that''s the effect you intended. 8)</td>', 'I think you have a good idea here, but those colored speckles in the top of the lantern really distract me -- they remind me of the sprinkles they put on donuts, and I doubt that''s the effect you intended. 8)', '2005-10-30 20:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825357, 246927, 35545, '<td valign="top">You certainly got the effect of sand here, but IMHO this has crossed the line and become digital art, not photography.</td>', 'You certainly got the effect of sand here, but IMHO this has crossed the line and become digital art, not photography.', '2005-10-30 20:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825358, 248275, 35545, '<td valign="top">Great mood.</td>', 'Great mood.', '2005-10-30 20:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825359, 247305, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good mood.</td>', 'Good mood.', '2005-10-30 20:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825364, 247923, 45575, '<td valign="top">Love it.</td>', 'Love it.', '2005-10-30 20:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1825367, 248415, 45575, '<td valign="top">i really like this one. it gives me a spooky feeling.</td>', 'i really like this one. it gives me a spooky feeling.', '2005-10-30 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
