(1825651, 248256, 41522, '<td valign="top">I think the grain is a nice added touch for this shot.  Gives an added character to the sky and overall, a old time nostalgic feel.  Nice comp.</td>', 'I think the grain is a nice added touch for this shot.  Gives an added character to the sky and overall, a old time nostalgic feel.  Nice comp.', '2005-10-30 22:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
