(1825665, 245561, 41522, '<td valign="top">Well done.  The grain adds something to this in terms of mood.  I flip flop back and forth about the position of the hand ... sometimes I want it at a different line and sometimes I like it just where it is ... probably that means it''s fine where it is.  Nice processing!!!!</td>', 'Well done.  The grain adds something to this in terms of mood.  I flip flop back and forth about the position of the hand ... sometimes I want it at a different line and sometimes I like it just where it is ... probably that means it''s fine where it is.  Nice processing!!!!', '2005-10-30 22:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
