(1825672, 248286, 41522, '<td valign="top">I like this shot and I think that grain on this adds to the gritty feel of the tunnel.  I think I would have liked a little burningon the faces to bring the faces back from being washed out.  Overall, a nice image with good composition and a nice part of this challenge.</td>', 'I like this shot and I think that grain on this adds to the gritty feel of the tunnel.  I think I would have liked a little burningon the faces to bring the faces back from being washed out.  Overall, a nice image with good composition and a nice part of this challenge.', '2005-10-30 22:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
