(1825786, 248431, 39057, '<td valign="top">*** I moved this from a 9 to a 10. This better win. When taken as a "whole" it is the perfect photo for this challenge.<br/> <br/>The HORROR!   Very nice set-up. It almost looks like you really did have this girl tied up and was showing her how you were going to hurt her. She is a very good actress (I hope !). Her hair is perfect for this shot also. This is strange but it looks as though there is a "Satan" figure on the top right hand side of the tape !<br/> <br/>There seems to be a slight green tint to the grain on the left side of her face. If not for the green I would give a 10....This however gets a 9 from me. Good Job. I think it will win.</td>', '*** I moved this from a 9 to a 10. This better win. When taken as a "whole" it is the perfect photo for this challenge. The HORROR!   Very nice set-up. It almost looks like you really did have this girl tied up and was showing her how you were going to hurt her. She is a very good actress (I hope !). Her hair is perfect for this shot also. This is strange but it looks as though there is a "Satan" figure on the top right hand side of the tape ! There seems to be a slight green tint to the grain on the left side of her face. If not for the green I would give a 10....This however gets a 9 from me. Good Job. I think it will win.', '2005-10-30 23:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
