(1825889, 246709, 26756, '<td valign="top">hmmmm.  Gotta say that as a photo I really loved this one...thought the mood, the pose, the entire setting and composition was fantastic.  But I didn''t peg this as a winner for this particular challenge.  Too much emphasis on the grunge, and I think the grain doesn''t look natural...it didn''t blend well with the other processing techniques, in my humble little opinion.<br/> <br/>You know I love your work, but I think you got some brownie points on this one because it was obviously your pic.  Dont get me wrong, it''s a fantastic image....just think it finished higher than it should.  I''d LOVE to see this photo processed in other ways, because the whole idea of the shot is just fantastic.<br/> <br/>In any case, congrats on another win.</td>', 'hmmmm.  Gotta say that as a photo I really loved this one...thought the mood, the pose, the entire setting and composition was fantastic.  But I didn''t peg this as a winner for this particular challenge.  Too much emphasis on the grunge, and I think the grain doesn''t look natural...it didn''t blend well with the other processing techniques, in my humble little opinion. You know I love your work, but I think you got some brownie points on this one because it was obviously your pic.  Dont get me wrong, it''s a fantastic image....just think it finished higher than it should.  I''d LOVE to see this photo processed in other ways, because the whole idea of the shot is just fantastic. In any case, congrats on another win.', '2005-10-31 00:12:42.000000', NULL, 0),
