(1825972, 248492, 12253, '<td valign="top">This was one of the most well posed and creatively processed shots in the challenge.  The expression alone was worth top 20.  Reminds me of some of the expressions I see on Salvador Dali shots.  <br/> <br/>I don''t know if you continue to use these post challenge--but perhaps think about a crop at the top to 1/4" above your right eyebrow (actually, cut point would be just below that one downward pointing hair mid upper right.  I think that might bring more prominance to your fantastic expression.</td>', 'This was one of the most well posed and creatively processed shots in the challenge.  The expression alone was worth top 20.  Reminds me of some of the expressions I see on Salvador Dali shots.   I don''t know if you continue to use these post challenge--but perhaps think about a crop at the top to 1/4" above your right eyebrow (actually, cut point would be just below that one downward pointing hair mid upper right.  I think that might bring more prominance to your fantastic expression.', '2005-10-31 00:29:52.000000', NULL, 0),
