(1826006, 247521, 12253, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Thanks for calling my attention to this again.  I don''t know what the crowd was thinking when they voted this.  It''s marvelous--every bit as good as my 20th place.  Very painterly and beautiful!<br/> <br/>I don''t really see the spinning technique in this, to me it looks like a veil.  So if I understood you correctly, and you spun it--you have mastered it beyond me!  That''s a new fav for me!</td>', 'Wow.  Thanks for calling my attention to this again.  I don''t know what the crowd was thinking when they voted this.  It''s marvelous--every bit as good as my 20th place.  Very painterly and beautiful! I don''t really see the spinning technique in this, to me it looks like a veil.  So if I understood you correctly, and you spun it--you have mastered it beyond me!  That''s a new fav for me!', '2005-10-31 00:38:42.000000', NULL, 0);
