(1826535, 246709, 37961, '<td valign="top">I think this is one of your best photos to date. Atleast for me the emotion is intense in this photo and the viewer gets a strong sense of compassion or interest for the subject. For you to have been able to envision this shot before you ever got to the field speaks clearly of your destiny and genius. <br/> <br/>You know your my hero. LOL</td>', 'I think this is one of your best photos to date. Atleast for me the emotion is intense in this photo and the viewer gets a strong sense of compassion or interest for the subject. For you to have been able to envision this shot before you ever got to the field speaks clearly of your destiny and genius.  You know your my hero. LOL', '2005-10-31 07:29:42.000000', NULL, 0),
