(1826539, 248439, 37961, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Heida. I had initally given this photo a 7 in my first pass. But later when I was tweaking my votes, it started to reel me in and I bumped it to a 10. The feeling of divine light in the tunnel, or the insinuation of walking toward the light moved me, but also the way the photo is make up of grain, like its not even a solid structure, but just dots almost. Great Entry.</td>', 'Congratulations Heida. I had initally given this photo a 7 in my first pass. But later when I was tweaking my votes, it started to reel me in and I bumped it to a 10. The feeling of divine light in the tunnel, or the insinuation of walking toward the light moved me, but also the way the photo is make up of grain, like its not even a solid structure, but just dots almost. Great Entry.', '2005-10-31 07:32:10.000000', NULL, 0),
