(1826859, 248262, 25095, '<td valign="top">I am no expert on grain and couldn''t enter or vote on the members challenge but here is my $.02 (probably worth less).<br/> <br/>Not sure if there is a big difference between grain and noise (I would think so).  I look at the image and I see multi-colored noise, mind you it isn''t a lot of colors but I see enough to say it is not just grain and others that voted may have thought the same.<br/> <br/>It is a good picture with good detail and lighting, focus and DOF but also doesn''t hold my interest for an extended amount of time.  I vote higher on images that make me stop and look at the entire picture and really amaze me.<br/> <br/>Sorry you didn''t do as well as you hoped...this is the story of my life over and over again. :o)</td>', 'I am no expert on grain and couldn''t enter or vote on the members challenge but here is my $.02 (probably worth less). Not sure if there is a big difference between grain and noise (I would think so).  I look at the image and I see multi-colored noise, mind you it isn''t a lot of colors but I see enough to say it is not just grain and others that voted may have thought the same. It is a good picture with good detail and lighting, focus and DOF but also doesn''t hold my interest for an extended amount of time.  I vote higher on images that make me stop and look at the entire picture and really amaze me. Sorry you didn''t do as well as you hoped...this is the story of my life over and over again. :o)', '2005-10-31 11:25:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1826876, 248356, 24013, '<td valign="top">i think this is the best one.  really different and original!</td>', 'i think this is the best one.  really different and original!', '2005-10-31 11:29:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1826888, 248356, 20462, '<td valign="top">I must chime in as well.  Amazing picture, creative use of color, scary score, should be top three with gaurawa.  Yours and gaurawas are the two best, easily.</td>', 'I must chime in as well.  Amazing picture, creative use of color, scary score, should be top three with gaurawa.  Yours and gaurawas are the two best, easily.', '2005-10-31 11:32:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1826891, 247365, 40718, '<td valign="top">ha, I''m happy I guessed it was you.  Sorry to harsh on you about the grain, but this picture should be one you are proud of.  It''s a great shot.</td>', 'ha, I''m happy I guessed it was you.  Sorry to harsh on you about the grain, but this picture should be one you are proud of.  It''s a great shot.', '2005-10-31 11:34:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(1826895, 248262, 40386, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot, animals dont always go down well here (ask me most of my shots are cats and horses!!), the grain is nice but I think it might have had more impact and maybe scored a bit higher if the kitty had been looking at the camera (easier said than done when working with animals I know believe me).  I took the liberty of playing with the shot a bit in PS, upped the contrast a fraction, brought down the brightness a smidgen and coverted to greyscale and feel it improved the shot.  Give it a try, hope this helps.</td>', 'I liked this shot, animals dont always go down well here (ask me most of my shots are cats and horses!!), the grain is nice but I think it might have had more impact and maybe scored a bit higher if the kitty had been looking at the camera (easier said than done when working with animals I know believe me).  I took the liberty of playing with the shot a bit in PS, upped the contrast a fraction, brought down the brightness a smidgen and coverted to greyscale and feel it improved the shot.  Give it a try, hope this helps.', '2005-10-31 11:35:45.000000', NULL, 0),
