(1827177, 248262, 30861, '<td valign="top">Leaving grain issues aside, the main "shortcoming" of this shot is a lack of "life" in the eyes. Typically on animal face closeups like this a sense of luminosity int he eyes pays big bonus points. Also this image is overall very flat feeling, with little tonal variation even between cat and BG, let alone throughout the cat itself.<br/> <br/>Sharpness and DOF are exceptionally nice here. It''s all-in-all a very nice image; it just lacks that extra POP that would boost its memorability factor.</td>', 'Leaving grain issues aside, the main "shortcoming" of this shot is a lack of "life" in the eyes. Typically on animal face closeups like this a sense of luminosity int he eyes pays big bonus points. Also this image is overall very flat feeling, with little tonal variation even between cat and BG, let alone throughout the cat itself. Sharpness and DOF are exceptionally nice here. It''s all-in-all a very nice image; it just lacks that extra POP that would boost its memorability factor.', '2005-10-31 14:09:09.000000', NULL, 0),
