(1829210, 248439, 37276, '<td valign="top">Splendid - I didn''t see all the hubub about you "stuck" but honestly - you HAVE style, so DO NOT let them get you down about it! Think these people would''ve been as upset with A Adams? Absolutely - and he was stuck in a great way too. You found a niche and I''d stay there. I LOVE YOUR WORK! :) Congrats and well deserved. You are just so inspirational Heida.</td>', 'Splendid - I didn''t see all the hubub about you "stuck" but honestly - you HAVE style, so DO NOT let them get you down about it! Think these people would''ve been as upset with A Adams? Absolutely - and he was stuck in a great way too. You found a niche and I''d stay there. I LOVE YOUR WORK! :) Congrats and well deserved. You are just so inspirational Heida.', '2005-11-01 07:38:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1829217, 246709, 42840, '<td valign="top">u have internet way over there?? :O</td>', 'u have internet way over there?? :O', '2005-11-01 07:47:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1829293, 248466, 37719, '<td valign="top">Hmm....now that I know which is yours I will again state I see no image grain at all.  And funny how every comment that states they don''t see grain, you do not check as helpful.  Did you slam and insult everyone in the forums as you did me for not seeing grain in your image?  7 comments and only one says anything about grain in your shot and even then they say gritty not grainy.  One of your 10''s the commentor even says it doesn''t fit the challenge - no grain.</td>', 'Hmm....now that I know which is yours I will again state I see no image grain at all.  And funny how every comment that states they don''t see grain, you do not check as helpful.  Did you slam and insult everyone in the forums as you did me for not seeing grain in your image?  7 comments and only one says anything about grain in your shot and even then they say gritty not grainy.  One of your 10''s the commentor even says it doesn''t fit the challenge - no grain.', '2005-11-01 08:25:22.000000', NULL, 0),
