(1831920, 247358, 44172, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t vote in this challenge and I don''t know much about much - but I really like this image. I think it should have placed higher - only 1 comment and a crappy one at that! It''s a great idea and title - I think you did a great job!</td>', 'I couldn''t vote in this challenge and I don''t know much about much - but I really like this image. I think it should have placed higher - only 1 comment and a crappy one at that! It''s a great idea and title - I think you did a great job!', '2005-11-02 02:08:41.000000', NULL, 0),
