(1834393, 247751, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Liked this but, criticism; wasn''t enough grain for me for the Challenge.  Like the ''composition'', but just to contradict that, I think a different crop/framing (maybe more ''space'' to the right?) may have made this better in my opinion.  I imagine this with a ''wide angle'' type frame (obviously the 640 dimensions restrict that here).  Would also like to have seen more ''contrast'', some richer toning.  More detail too if possible (ie: sharpening) on the buffalo &amp; calf, even though ''more grain'' would have diminished the detail, if that makes sense.</td>', '6 - Liked this but, criticism; wasn''t enough grain for me for the Challenge.  Like the ''composition'', but just to contradict that, I think a different crop/framing (maybe more ''space'' to the right?) may have made this better in my opinion.  I imagine this with a ''wide angle'' type frame (obviously the 640 dimensions restrict that here).  Would also like to have seen more ''contrast'', some richer toning.  More detail too if possible (ie: sharpening) on the buffalo & calf, even though ''more grain'' would have diminished the detail, if that makes sense.', '2005-11-02 19:27:47.000000', NULL, 0),
