(2087365, 247370, 12611, '<td valign="top">absolutely terrific mood and feel here. there is definite feel of maroon red and green but it is so subtle its terrific. Perhaps the horizon is a touch off kilter, but nonetheless, quite nice.</td>', 'absolutely terrific mood and feel here. there is definite feel of maroon red and green but it is so subtle its terrific. Perhaps the horizon is a touch off kilter, but nonetheless, quite nice.', '2006-01-26 08:48:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2096797, 248364, 17507, '<td valign="top">this is a really great idea. it got voted way lower than it deserved. I think that the main improvement that could be made is the angle - think about the lines in the shot. as this is, all the lines are pretty much parallel, heading out of the shot. from a lower angle, the lines would converge to a point within the composition. try to use the lines to keep the viewer''s eye within the frame.</td>', 'this is a really great idea. it got voted way lower than it deserved. I think that the main improvement that could be made is the angle - think about the lines in the shot. as this is, all the lines are pretty much parallel, heading out of the shot. from a lower angle, the lines would converge to a point within the composition. try to use the lines to keep the viewer''s eye within the frame.', '2006-01-28 23:50:17.000000', NULL, 0),
