(2230215, 247053, 24503, '<td valign="top">Don''t ask me why, but love this picture. It''s grainy, has a lot of color noise, focus isn''t as sharp as could be technically correct, but it touches me. It has something I like. Well done.</td>', 'Don''t ask me why, but love this picture. It''s grainy, has a lot of color noise, focus isn''t as sharp as could be technically correct, but it touches me. It has something I like. Well done.', '2006-03-15 11:19:59.000000', NULL, 0),
