(2321374, 248364, 28710, '<td valign="top">This is actually pretty cool. I like the angle of the rabbit ears and the overall composition. One thing I noticed that I''m not sure about is that there seems to be quite a bit of glare on the screen and a few parts of the TV surface. I am not sure if this was intended, but perhaps could have been avoided by diffusing the light source yet more or bouncing it in where the glare would have been reduced. It seems a pretty minor nitpick.<br/> <br/>I like how you worked to keep the lighting in somewhat unnatural straight lines on the floor. Great depth too!</td>', 'This is actually pretty cool. I like the angle of the rabbit ears and the overall composition. One thing I noticed that I''m not sure about is that there seems to be quite a bit of glare on the screen and a few parts of the TV surface. I am not sure if this was intended, but perhaps could have been avoided by diffusing the light source yet more or bouncing it in where the glare would have been reduced. It seems a pretty minor nitpick. I like how you worked to keep the lighting in somewhat unnatural straight lines on the floor. Great depth too!', '2006-04-18 09:01:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2349386, 247284, 51553, '<td valign="top">I like the off center composition.</td>', 'I like the off center composition.', '2006-04-27 01:51:53.000000', NULL, 0),
